<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version .</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka ya chitabu chimwe mne pfitabu pfine ipfili mne Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli inoghile). Tsapfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Luka ng'andike bae mbuli tsa Yesu tsiliheka, ila pfipfila kandika mne chitabu cha Ghamatendo ghe iwatumighwa pfinu pfawatendile wanang'ina wa Yesu hambele he ukufa na ukutsilihuka kwa Yesu. Haduhu imunu iyomanya ghendo Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka yandikighwe tsuwachi au kwani, ila iwasomi wengi wotoghola ka yandikighwa kune miyaka ya sabini kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyandike tsakakala Luka, iyakalile bwana mghanga. Pfandike na ilugha yaitumile kolangusa ka yeye tsakakala msomi. Luka tsakabama yandike pfinoghile ghendo mbuli tsa Yesu, tsakandika ipfinu ka pfapfilawile, ili wanu wangi hawosoma wadahe kumanya ghoya mbuli tsa Yesu. (Luka 1:1-3) Yeye tsa si Myahudi bae (Kolo 4:10-14) apfo kandika kwa nzila iitenda iwanu iwali si wayahudi wadahe kupfimanya ghoya. Chinu chino chakoneka mwatsi hala halongile pfihendo pfa Wayahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka yeghala ghendo na pfitabu pfa Matei na Maliki, kwaapfila pfolonga pfinu pfimwe na kwa nzila iighala. Mna pfitabu pfino pfidatu, Luka kandika mbuli nyingi tsa ukwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa. Pfipfila Luka kokomangitsa ukuleghusighwa nzambi. (isula ya 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na ghamaombi (isula ya 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-4, Luka koitambulisha Imbuli Inoghile na kolonga ule kayandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:5-4:13, kolonga ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu na pfayandae kwa isang'ano yake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 4:14-21:38, kolonga ng'onde tsatendile Yesu, ghendoghendo pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfatendile na pfinu pfalangulitse.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 22-24, komalitsila kwa ukulonga mbuli tsa ukufa kwa Yesu, pfatsikighwe, na pfatsilihuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imkulu Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanu wengi tsawandusa ukwandika pfawadahile tsimbuli tse ipfinu ipfitendeke mghati mwetu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsawandika ipfinu pfatulongelighwe ne iwanu iwonile ipfinu pfino kulawa mwanduso, ne iwanu wawala iwalongile tsimbuli tsinoghile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Aghweye Imkulu, kwaapfila imwenyegho nipfibama ipfinu pfino pfose kulawa mwanduso, tsambona pfinogha ukukwandikila ghoya ipfinu pfilawile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Notenda pfino naghwe umanye ukweli wose we ipfinu pfaulangusilighwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa kwolangusighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mna matsuwa ghala Herodi hayakalile imndewa wa Yudeya, tsakukala na mlapfa nambiko yumwe yakemighwe Sakariya, kolawila mna walapfa nambiko wa Abiya. Mwehe wake kakemighwa Elisabeti naye kolawa mne lukolo lwe Aruni, mlapfa nambiko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wose weli wakala wanogha kwe Imulungu, aku wakinda ghendo ghamalaghitso ghose ghe Imtwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wose tsawahela iwana kwaapfila Elisabeti yang'ali ng'akweleka bae, na wose tsawalala ghendo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Zakariya kakala mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu kotenda isang'ano yake ya kutambika, tsaikala nzamu yake. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Zakariya tsakasaghulighwa kwa kwasa simbi, ka watambika pfawang'ali wotendagha. Apfo kengila mng'anda mwe Imtwatsa akadusule ubani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ne ichipindi che<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="fk">Ichipindi cha kudusula ubani </char> saa tisa nemisi.</note> kupfukitsa ubani pfachitsile, iwanu wose wakala wolomba kunze.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya malaika we Imtwatsa, kamlawila, kema ubali wa kujilo wa hanu hala kupfukitsila ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sakariya hamwonile, keduka kuya kapfuka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imalaika kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka, Sakariya! Imulungu kahulika chaumlombile. Mwehe wako katsokwelekela imwana immale naghwe kutsomkema Yohane. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kutsosekelela ng'ani na kudeng'elela, ne iwanu wengi watsodeng'elela kwa ukwelekighwa kwake! <verse number="15" style="v"/>Katsakuwa imunu imkulu hambele he Imtwatsa. Ng'atsakunwa bae idipfai wala mbwali. Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu katsommemetsa kulawa litsuwa lya ukwelekighwa kwake. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Katsowoyitsa iwanu wengi we Isiraeli woye kwe Imtwatsa Imulungu wawo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Katsolongola hambele he Imtwatsa, katsakuwa ne ingupfu na ghumuhe ka nabii Eliya. Tsina aba watsowanoghela keli iwana wao, katsowoyitsa iwanu ing'awohulika woye mne ukwalangula kunoghile ka iwanu iwomuhulika Imulungu, katsowatenda iwanu weyandae kumbokela Imtwatsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Sakariya kamghutsa imalaika, “Nitsomanyatse ka ichinu chino chakuwa apfo? Nene nilala na mwehe wangu pfipfila kalala” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imalaika kamwidika, “Nene na Gaburieli. Nakwima hanu he Imulungu, iyanitumile nonge naghwe, na nikulongele imbuli ino inoghile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwitsenyamala tulu kwaapfila ng'ughatoghola bae aghano ighatsolawila mna msimu wake, ng'utsodaha bae ukulonga mbaka aghano ghanikulongele haghotsolawila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwanu iwang'ali wombeta Sakariya wetsina hayang'ali yokawa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Baho halawile kunze, ng'adahile bae ukulonga nawo, apfo wamanya kona ghamaono mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kalonga nawo kwa ghamoko ghake, kwaapfila ng'adahile bae ukulonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Matsuwa ghake gha kusang'ana aghamalile, Sakariya koya ukaye. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Aghabitile matsuwa mengi mwehe wake kakinda inda. Tsakepfisa mng'anda kwa miyetsi mitano. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tsakalonga, “Apfi pfipfo pfanendele Imulungu mna matsuwa ghala hambonele libatsi kunenda ndeke kona keli ichinyala mne iwanu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu kwolangusighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 1:26-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mna ghumwetsi ghwa sita ghwe inda ya Elizabeti Imulungu kamtuma malaika yokemighwa Gaburieli aghende mne ghumji ghwa Natsareti mne isi ya Galilaya, <verse number="27" style="v"/>kwe imwali iyalapfighwe tsengele ne immale yakemighwe Yosefu, yalawile mne lukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi. Imwaliyo tsakakemighwa Mariya. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Malaika tsakamtsila imwaliyo kamlongela, “Haulamke! Imtwatsa kahamwe naghwe, naye kakubaliki!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mariya hayahulike mbuli ayo, tsakalangula mne ghumoyo ghwake, naye kakangawala imbuli ino ina mana yachi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Malaika kamlongela, “Mariya, uleke kupfuka! Imulungu kakutendela uluso. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kutsokinda inda na kutsakweleka imwana immale, kutsomwing'a taghwa Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Katsakuwa mkulu na katsokemighwa Imwana we Imulungu yali Kuchanya Ng'ani. Imtwatsa Imulungu katsomwing'a chighoda cha undewa che imbala wake Daudi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Katsokuwa imndewa we iwana wa Yakobu ghamatsuwa ghose, ne undewa wake ng'autsomala bae!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mariya kalonga ne malaika, “Nene na-mwali sina niwase bae ne immale. Kuya lelo itsakuwatse?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Malaika kamwidika, “Ghumuhe Mwenzeka katsokutsila, na ngupfu tse Imulungu tsitsokughubika. Apfo imwana mwenzeluka katsakwelekighwa, katsokemighwa Imwana we Imulungu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwomkumbuka ndughu yako Elizabeti. Tsailongighwa ng'atsokweleka bae iwana, lekeni sambi kana inda ya miyetsi sita, pfipfo pfayali mnzehe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kuduhu ichinu Imulungu ng'ochidaha bae kuchitenda.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mariya kalonga; “Nene na imtumwa we Imtwatsa, nendelighwe ka pfaulongile.” Kuya malaika ayo koka.</para>
  <para style="s">Mariya komwangila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 1:39-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Matsuwa ghaghala Mariya katsumka kaghenda mne ghumji ighuli mne pfidunda pfa isi ya Yudeya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ako kengila mne ing'anda ya Sakariya, kamlamsa Elisabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elisabeti hayahulike Mariya komlamsa, imwana kadaluka munda mwake. Elisabeti kamemetsighwa na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kalonga kwa kukemelela, “Kubweda kubita iwapinga wose, ne imwana yutsomweleka kabalikiighwa! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ebali chinu chino chindawila nene, mbaka mai we Imtwatsa wangu yanyangile nene? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hanihulike kwondamsa, imwana kadaluka munda mwangu kwa ndeng'elelo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ng'apfu ghweghwe yutoghole ka ghatsolawila aghala ghayakulongele Imtwatsa”</para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mariya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ghumoyo ghwangu ghomtoghola Imtwatsa;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>ghumoyo ghwangu ghwomdeng'elela Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">iyali Mkombotsi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>kwaapfila kaukumbuka udodo we imtumwa wake!</para>
  <para style="q">Kulawa sambi na kughendelela</para>
  <para style="q">iwanu wose watsong'ema na imunu iyebwedile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>kwaapfila Imulungu yane Ngupfu kanendela makulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Taghwa lye Imulungu lyenzeluka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kowonela libatsi iwanu wala iwompfuka.</para>
  <para style="q">libatsi lyake lyokala lweleko mbaka lweleko lungi <verse number="51" style="v"/>Tsakatenda ipfinu pfikulu kwa ghumoko ghwake.</para>
  <para style="q">Kawapwililisa iwanu iweghodile mne imimoyo yawo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawahulumsa iwandewa kulawa kune ipfighoda pfawo pfa undewa,</para>
  <para style="q">na kawenula iwali mbughilambughila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kawaghutisa wane inzala kwa pfinu pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q">na kawawinga matajiri ghamoko ghaliyeka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kamwapfila imtumwa wake Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q">na ng'esemwile bae kumlangusa libatsi lyake.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kakumbuka kumwonela libatsi Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="q">na lukolo lwake ghamatsuwa ghose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mariya kakala na Elizabeti kwa miyetsi midatu, kuya koya ukaye yake.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Matsuwa gha Elisabeti tsaghapfika ukweleka imwana, naye keleka imwana immale. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Iwanu wali habehi yake ne iwandughu tsake hawahulike Imulungu pfamwonele libatsi sideke, wose wadeng'elela naye. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Imwana hapfikile matsuwa manane, watsa kumwingitsa ngoma. Wabama kumwing'a taghwa Sakariya, taghwa lya aba wake. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Kuya mai wake kalonga, “Bae! Taghwa lyake katsokemighwa Yohane!” <verse number="61" style="v"/>Walonga, “Pfii mbona kwahela ndughu iyokemighwa taghwa lino mlukolo lwako!” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Kuya walonga kwa ghamoko na aba wake wamghutsa taghwa lyachi kobama imwanaghe yakemighwe. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Sakariya kalomba chibao cho kwandikila, kuya kandika, “Taghwa lyake Yohane.” Wose wakangawala! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Bahala Zakariya kadaha ukulonga keli, kandusa ukumtunya Imulungu. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Iwanu wali habehi yake wapfuka, na mbuli tse ipfinu pfino tsenela kwose kune ipfidunda pfe isi ya Yudeya. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Chila imunu yahulike imbuli ino kalangula, keghutsa, “Pfii imwana yuno atsakuwa mwana wachi?” Kwaapfila ingupfu ye Imtwatsa yakwoneka ghendo ikala naye.</para>
  <para style="s">Utabili wa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Sakariya aba wake Yohane kamemesighwa na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, naye katabili imbuli kulawa kwe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Lekani tumtunye Imtwatsa, Imulungu wa Isiraeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaapfila kawatsila iwanu wake na kuwakombola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Katwing'a twetwe Mkombotsi yane ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q">mtsukulu wa imtumwa wake Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Ka pfalongile kulawa ghumwande kubitila manabii wake wahenzeluka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>kutukombola kulawa kwe iwehile wetu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kulawa kune ingupfu ya wose iwotwihila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Tsakalonga katsowonela libatsi iwabala wetu</para>
  <para style="q">na katsokumbuka lilaghano lyake lyenzeluke.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Kelighita ghendo kwa Abrahamu imbala wetu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>katsotukombola kulawa kwe iwanu iwotwihila.</para>
  <para style="q">Na katwapfila tudahe kumsang'anila bila kupfuka,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>tuwe wenzeluka na tuwe iwanu wanoghile hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q">matsuwa ghose gha ughima wetu.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Ghweghwe imwanangu, kutsokemighwa nabii we Imulungu yali Uchanya ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="q">Kutsomlongolela Imtwatsa umgholosele inzila yake.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>Kuwalongela iwanu wake watsokombolighwa</para>
  <para style="q">kwa kuleghusighwa nzambi tsawo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Imulungu wetu kana libatsi na ghumoyo ghunoghile.</para>
  <para style="q">Katsowamwemwesela ghumwanga ghwa ukombotsi kulawa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>Ghutsowamwemwesela iwanu wose iwali mne ichisi na sisila lya ifwa</para>
  <para style="q">aghalongotse maghulu ghetu mne nzila iili tseghamba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Imwana kakula na kongetseka ingupfu mmuhe. Kakala kunyika mbaka litsuwa hawalawilile iwanu wa Isiraeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 2:1-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghala Agusto, Imndewa wa Roma, tsakalaghitsa iwanu wose wa undewa wa Roma wapetighwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aluno lwa mwanduso kwe iwanu kupetighwa, Kurenio hawile mkulu we isi ya Siriya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya, chila imunu kaghenda kune ghumji ghwake kwandikighwa taghwa lyake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yosefu kalawa ghumji ghwa Natsareti ighuli mna isi ya Galilaya, kaghenda ghumji ghwa Betilehemu ighuli mna isi ya Yudeya, hanu helekighwe mndewa Daudi. Yosefu kaghenda ako kwaapfila kalawila mne lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kaghenda na Mariya kupetighwa, ipinga yamlapfile tsengele, yakalile ne inda. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wa Betilehemu, litsuwa lyake lya ukweleka lipfika, <verse number="7" style="v"/>keleka imwanaghe chaudele, kampfatsa pfibwende. Kuya kamuwasitsa mne ichibumbulika hanu hawajilagha iwanyama, kwaapfila ng'awapatile bae hanu ho kukala mne ing'anda ya iwahenza.</para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi we iwang'olo na Wamalaika</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 2:8-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mna isi iila tsakukala na wadimi iwang'ali wokalitsa imipfugho yawo nechilo.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">2. Iwadimi wololesa wang'olo wawo</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Imalaika we Imtwatsa kawalawila, ne utunitso we Imtwatsa uwamwemwesela, nawo wapfuka ghendo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni malaika ayo kawalongela, “Mleke ukupfuka! Niwaghalila imbuli inoghile, iitsowadeng'eletsa iwanu wose. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Leloli kune ghumji ghwa Daudi kelekighwa Mkombotsi wenu; yeye iyo Kiristu,<note caller="c" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="fk">Kiristu </char> Mkombotsi yasaghulighwe ne Imulungu kughwa Imndewa. </note> Imtwatsa! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Achino chitsakuwa chitango kuna mwemwe. Mtsomwona imwana mdodo, wampfatsa ipfibwende, wamuwatsisa hanu ho kujila iwanyama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bahala, kingili kulu lye iwamalaika litingana ne malaika ayo, wamtunya Imulungu, walonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Utunitso kwe Imulungu yali uchanya ng'ani kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">na tseghamba kwe iwanu iwali mne isi yose iwanoghelighwe naye”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwamalaika awo hawoyile kulanga, wadimi welongela, “Tukeni Betilehemu tukalole acho ichilawile, chatulongele Imtwatsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo watsuma, wawapfika Mariya na Yosefu, na ayula imwana mdodo kawasitsighwa hanu ho ukujila iwanyama. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wadimi awo hawamwonile imwana yula, wawalongela mbuli tse imwana tsawalongile malaika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wose iwahulike agho, wakangawala na mbuli tsawalongile wadimi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni Mariya kagheka agha ghose mna ghumoyo ghwake na kaghatonga ng'ani. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Awala iwadimi woya kunyika, wamtunya Imulungu na kumwimbila kwa ghose ghawahulike na ghawonile, ghose ghalawila ka malaika pfawalongele.</para>
  <para style="s">Imwana kakwing'ighwa taghwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya nane, litsuwa lya kumwingitsa ngoma imwana halipfikile, kakemighwa taghwa lyake Yesu. Taghwa alyo tsakeng'ighwa na malaika ahala mai wake ng'ana ame inda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kune Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa tsaghapfika gha Yosefu na Mariya kutenda ichihendo cha kudeghetetsighwa ka Ghamalaghitso gha Musa pfagholaghitsa. Apfo wamsola imwana, waghenda naye kune ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu kumwika hambele he Imtwatsa, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ka pfayandikighwe mne Ghamalaghitso ghe Imtwatsa Imulungu; “Chila imwana immale chaudele alapfighwe kwe Imtwatsa.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya tsawaghenda ili watambike, walapfe njiwa weli au makinda meli ka Ghamalaghitso ghe Imtwatsa pfagholaghitsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ako Yerusalemu tsakukala na imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Simoni. Imunu ayo tsakakala kanogha na kompfuka Imulungu. Ayo yang'ali yobetetsa ukutsa kwa ukombotsi wa Isiraeli, naye tsakakala na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kamlongela ng'atsakufa bae mbaka amwone Kiristu yasaghulighwe ne Imtwatsa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kamlongotsa Simoni kaghenda kune Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kuya aba na mai wake Yesu wamghala imwana wawo mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu wamtendele ka pfaibamighwe mne ichihendo cha Ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simoni kamsola imwana Yesu mna ghamoko ghake, kuya kamtunya Imulungu, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Sambi Imtwatsa, mlekelele imtumwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q">yoke tseghamba, ka pfulongile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa tsinenge tsangu niwona ukombotsi wako,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>uutendile woneke kuna iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ghumwanga ighutsowamwemwesela iwanu wose iwali si Wayahudi bae,</para>
  <para style="q">na litsoghala utunitso kwe iwanu wako wa Isiraeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Aba wake na mai wake Yesu wang'ali wokangawala na mbuli tse imwana tsayalongile Simoni. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simoni kawabaliki, kamlongela Mariya, mai wake Yesu, “Imwana yuno kasaghulighwa ne Imulungu kwa ukwagha na ukukombolighwa kwe iwanu wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli. Kuya katsakuwa chitango kulawa kwe Imulungu, ichitsolemighwa ne iwanu wengi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya ukwalangula mne imimoyo ye iwanu wengi kutsoghubulighwa mwatsi. Naghwe imwenyegho, usungu ka lipanga ilitema utsouhoma ghumoyo ghwako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tsakukala na nabii yumwe pinga, kakala mnzehe ghendo, tagwa lyake Ana, neghe Fanuweli, wa lukolo lwa Aseri. Ipinga ayo tsakakala na immale wake kwa miyaka saba kulawa kukwelighwa kwake. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya tsakakala chitsuka mbaka matsuwa ghala ghawile mnzehe wa miyaka semanini na mine. Na matsuwa agho ghose kakala mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, ang'ali yofunga ukuja na ukulomba chilo na misi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Saa iila ipinga ayo kalawila, kamlongela Imulungu mighede, kawalongela imbuli ye imwana yula kwe iwanu wose yawang'ali woubetela ukombotsi wa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yosefu na Mariya hawaghamalitse ghose ighobamighwa na Ghamalaghitso ghe Imtwatsa Imulungu, tsawoya ukaye yawo Natsareti, mne ghumji ghwa Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Imwana kakula, kongetseka ngupfu, kamema ihekima, na uluso we Imulungu ukala hamwe naye.</para>
  <para style="s">Imsongolo Yesu kamne ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Chila mwaka mne chihungo cha pasaka, welesi wake wang'ali woghendagha Yerusalemu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu hapfikile miyaka kumi na mili, tsawaghenda naye kune ichihungo ka pfawatendagha. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hawamalitse ichihungo, na hawang'ali wakuya ukaye yawo, Yesu tsakakala kuchugho Yerusalemu, aku welesi wake ng'awamanyile bae. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Tsawepfikitsa ka tsawawose mne ghumwanza, waghenda ghumwanza ghwa tsuwa limwe. Kuya wandusa kumbama mna iwandughu tsawo na sale tsawo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ng'awamwonile bae, apfo woya Yerusalemu kumbama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mna litsuwa lya kadatu, wampfika mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu mghati mwe iwalangulitsi wa Chiyahudi, ang'ali yowategheletsa na ukuwaghutsa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wose watsihulike mbuli tsake wakangawala na tsimbutsi tsake na apfila pfawedike. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Weletsi wake hawamwonile wakangawala ng'ani. Mai wake kamghutsa, “Mwanangu, ebali ututenda apfi? Nene na aba wako tung'ali tukubama kwa usungu.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Angu mnibamila choni? Ng'ammanyile bae nene nibamighwa nikale mne ing'anda ya Aba wangu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lekeni wao ng'awamanyile bae imbuli yawalongele ina mana yachi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kuya, koya nawo mbaka Natsareti ako ang'ali yowahulikitsa. Mai wake keka ipfinu pfose mne ghumoyo ghwake. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Na Yesu kakula na kongetseka ihekima na utali, na kumnoghelesa Imulungu ne iwanu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 3:1-12; Maliki 1:1-8; Yohane 1:19-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tano ghwa undewa wa Mndewa Tiberi, Pontiyo Pilato tsakakala mkulu wa isi ya Yudeya, Herodi tsakakala mkulu wa Galilaya, na ndughu yake Filipi tsakakala mkulu wa Ituleya na isi ya Tilakoniti, na Lusaniya tsakakala mkulu wa Abilene. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Anasi na Kayafa tsawakala iwakulu we inambiko. Mna matsuwa agho, imbuli ye Imulungu tsaimtsila Yohane, imwana wa Sakariya akula kunyika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfo, Yohane kanga isi yose iibakane na ghumto Yoridani. Kawapetela iwanu watsileke nzambi tsawo na wabatitsighwe, ili Imulungu awaleghusile nzambi tsawo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ka pfayandikighwe mne ichitabu cha nabii Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Litsi lye imunu lyokema kulawa kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mmwikile ghoya Imtwatsa nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q">mgholose nzila yake.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chila lwanda lutsomemetsighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">chila chidunda na sughulu pfitsomwaghaluka,</para>
  <para style="q">hanu hapfeduke hatsogholosighwa</para>
  <para style="q">nzila itsihile tsitsogholosighwa na kukala ghoya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na iwanu wose watsowona ukombotsi we Imulungu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wamghendela Yohane ili awabatitse, naye kawalongela, “Mwemwe iwana we nzoka! Yuhi yawalongele mwodaha kuhepa ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mtende aghala igholangusa ka mtsileka nzambi tsenu. Mleke kwilongela, ‘Abrahamu aba wetu!’ Nowalongela, kulawa mne ghamabwe ghano Imulungu kodaha kumlapfila Abrahamu iwana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya, hoya ikighwa ghoya msina mwe mibiki, apfo chila mbiki yang'aghukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile ghutsoghanighwa na kwasighwa mna ghumoto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kingili lye iwanu limghutsa, “Lelo tutandetse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yohane kawedika, “Imunu yane ghamaghwanda meli yamwing'e yula yalihela lighwanda, na yane ichijo yatende pfipfo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nawo iwasola kodi watsa wabatitsighwe, wamghutsa, “Imlangulitsi, twetwe tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nae kawalongela, “Mleke kusola kodi kubita pfamlaghitsighwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nawo asikali wamghutsa, “Na twetwe tutende choni?” Naye kawedika, “Mleke kuboka ipfinu pfe imunu wowose na mleke kumbangitsila imunu wowose. Mwenele na achila chamulihighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwanu wang'ali wololela ipfinu ipfitsolawila, wandusa kwalangula mna imimoyo yawo mbuli tsa Yohane, pfii ayu ka Kiristu? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Baho Yohane kawalongela wose, “Nene nowabatitsa mwemwe kwa ghamatsi, lekeni kakutsa yane ngupfu kubita nene, nene sidaha bae kumdoholela mitsabi ye imikwabatsa yake. Ayo katsowabatitsa kwa Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu na kwa ghumoto ghwa kuhigha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ayo kana lungo mne ghamoko ghake, abetele uhemba wake, awike hamwe mne ikano yake na katsolakatsa mikumvi mne ghumoto ing'aghutsimika bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apfo kwa mbuli tsingi, Yohane tsayang'ali yowapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni Yohane tsakamkembela Herodi, mkulu wa Galilaya, kwaapfila kamkwela Herodiya, mwehe wa ndughu yake, ne ipfinu pfingi pfihile pfatendile Herodi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya Herodi kongetsa ichinu chingi chihile kwa kumwika Yohane mne ligheretsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatitsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 3:13-17; Maliki 1:9-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwanu wose hawamalile kubatitsighwa, kuya Yesu kabatitsighwa. Na hang'ali yolomba, ililanga lighubuka, <verse number="22" style="v"/>na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ghumuhulumkila mne lukuli ka lwe injiwa. Litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Imwanangu yuninoghela, nonoghelighwa naghwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 1:1-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu handuse isang'ano yake tsakana miyaka ka selasini. Iwanu tsawepfikitsa yeye kakala imwana wa Yosefu, imwana wa Heli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Heli tsakakala imwana wa Matati, iyakalile imwana wa Lawi, imwana wa Meliki, imwana wa Yani, imwana wa Yosefu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Matatia, imwana wa Amosi, imwana wa Nahumu, imwana wa Hesili, imwana wa Nagai, <verse number="26" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Mahati, imwana wa Matatia, imwana wa Semeyi, imwana wa Yoseki, imwana wa Yuda, <verse number="27" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Yohaneni, imwana wa Resa, imwana wa Serubabeli, imwana wa Setieli, imwana wa Neri, <verse number="28" style="v"/>imwana wa Meliki, imwana we Adi, imwana wa Kosamu, iyakalile imwana we Elimadamu, imwana we Eri, <verse number="29" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Yoshua, imwana wa Eliyetseri, imwana wa Yorimu, imwana wa Matati, imwana wa Lawi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Simoni, imwana wa Yuda, imwana wa Yosefu, imwana wa Yonamu, imwana we Eliyakimu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Maleya, imwana wa Mena, imwana wa Matata, imwana wa Natani, imwana wa Daudi, <verse number="32" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Yese, imwana wa Obedi, imwana wa Boasi, imwana wa Salimoni, imwana wa Nasoni, <verse number="33" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Aminadabu, imwana we Adimini, imwana we Arini, imwana wa Hesironi, imwana wa Peresi, imwana wa Yuda, <verse number="34" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Yakobu, imwana we Isaka, imwana we Abrahamu, imwana wa Tera, imwana wa Nahori, <verse number="35" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Serugi, imwana wa Reyu, imwana wa Pelegi, imwana wa Eberi, imwana wa Sala, <verse number="36" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Kainamu, imwana wa Arifakisadi, imwana wa Shemu, imwana wa Nuhu, imwana wa Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Metusela, imwana wa Enoki, imwana wa Yaredi, imwana wa Mahalaleli, imwana wa Kainamu, <verse number="38" style="v"/>iyakalile imwana wa Enosi, imwana wa Seti, imwana wa Adamu, iyakalile imwana we Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kughetsigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:1-11; Maliki 1:12-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa mne ghumto Yoridani kamema Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, na Ghumuhe haghwo ghumlongotsa mbaka kunyika. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ako kaghetsighwa na Setani kwa matsuwa alubaini. Mne agho, ng'ajile bae chinu chochose, na matsuwa agho haghamalile tsakona nzala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Setani kamlongela; “Ka ghweghwe kwe Imwana wa Imulungu, ulilongele libwe lino liwe chighate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikighwa, ‘Imunu ng'odaha bae kuwa mghima kwa kuja chighate chiliyeka.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bahala Setani kamlongotsa Yesu mbaka kuchanya, kamlangusa undewa wose uli mne isi yose. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Setani kamlongela, “Nitsokwing'a undewa na ukulu mne pfinu pfose pfino, kwaapfila pfose pfamne ghamoko ghangu, na nene nodaha kumwing'a imunu wowose yanimbama.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nitsokwing'a ipfinu pfose pfino ka kutsonitambikila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikighwa, ‘Umtambikile Imtwatsa Imulungu wako, ne umsang'anile yeye yaliyeka!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya Setani kamlongotsa mbaka kune ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, mchiswili mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu, wilaghatse kulawa hano mbaka hasi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yandikighwa, ‘Imulungu katsowalaghitsa wamalaika wake wakulolese. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nawo watsokukinda mne ghamoko ghao, uleke kwikwala ghumghulu ghwako mne libwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Ilongighwa, ‘Uleke kumghetsa Imtwatsa Imulungu wako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Setani hayamalitse kumghetsa Yesu kwa chila chinu, kamleka chidogho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwandusa sang'ano yake Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:12-17; Maliki 1:14-15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu koya mne isi ya Galilaya kamema ingupfu ya Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. Mbuli tsake tsenela Galilaya na mne tsiisi itsili habehi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yang'ali yolangulitsa mne tsing'anda tsawo tsa ukulombela na iwanu wose wamtunya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:53-58; Maliki 6:1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu koya Natsareti hanu hayalelighwe. Mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, kaghenda mne ing'anda ye ukulombela ka pfayatsowele. Kema na kusoma Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Keng'ighwa ichitabu cha nabii Isaya. Kachipfughula, kahona hanu handikighwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ghumuhe ghwe Imtwatsa ghwa hachanya hangu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila kanisaghula nene niwaghalile wahingwa imbuli inoghile.</para>
  <para style="q">Kanituma niwapetele iwohighwe ka watsolekelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">ne ipfifita watsokona.</para>
  <para style="q">Na kuwalekelela iwanu iwoghaya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na kuwalongela ka matsuwa ghapfika</para>
  <para style="q">ghe Imtwatsa kuwakombola iwanu wake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kachighubika ichitabu, kamwing'a imtumwa, kuya kakala hasi. Iwanu wose mne ing'anda ye ukulombela wamtsodolela tsinenge. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Naye kawalongela, “Ighandikighwe leloli ghatimila mne ghamaghutwi ghenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wose wamtoghola, wakangawala na mbuli tsinoghile tsalongile. Walonga, “Angu ayu si imwana wa Yosefu bae?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nomanya mwodaha kunilongela imbuli ino, ‘Imghanga, wihonetse imwenyegho! Ghose ghatuhulike ghutendile akula Kaperinaumu, pfipfila ghatende hano ukaye yako’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kaghendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, nabii ng'otogholighwa bae ukaye yake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mnitegheletse! Nowalongelani ghendo tsakukala na pfitsuka wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli mna matsuwa gha nabii Eliya. matsuwa agho imvula ng'aitowile bae kwa miyaka midatu na miyetsi sita, apfo tsakukala ne inzala ng'ulu mne isi yose. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Eliya ng'atumighwe bae kwe chitsuka wowose, lekeni katumighwa kwe chitsuka yumwe iyakalile Sarefati mne isi ya Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mna matsuwa gha nabii Elisha tsakukala ne iwanu wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli iwoghula ukoma. Kuduhu imunu wowose yahonile, lekeni Naamani yaliyeka, imunu wa isi ya Siria.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Iwanu wose mne Ing'anda ye ukulombela hawahulike apfi wona maya ng'ani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wenuka, wamghala Yesu kunze kwa ghumji, na wamghala mchidando mwe chidunda, hanu ihatsengighwe kaye tsawo. Wabama wamwase kulwanda, <verse number="30" style="v"/>lekeni kabita mghati mwe kingili, koka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlapfa ichinyamkela kulawa kune imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:21-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kahulumka Kaperinaumu, ghumji ghwa Galilaya. Na mne litsuwa lya Sabato kandusa kuwalangulitsa iwanu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tsawakangawala kwa malangulitso ghake, kwaapfila ghalangulitse tsa ghana ngupfu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mne ing'anda ye ukulombela tsa kuna imunu yane ichinyamkela yehile, kakemelela kalonga, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Ubama kututenda choni, Yesu wa Natsareti? Kutsa kutukoma? Nokumanya ghweghwe kwa Imtumighwa Mwenzeluka we Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, “Winyamale, umlawe imunu yuno!” Kuya ichinyamkela kamghwisa hasi imunu ayo hambele hawo, kamlawa bila kumlagha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wakangawala ng'ani, welongela, “Ahino mbuli yachi lelo? Imunu yuno kodaha na kana ngupfu tsa kuwakembela ipfinyamkela, nawo womuhulika!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Apfo mbuli tsa Yesu tsenela mne isi yose ya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:14-17; Maliki 1:29-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kaghenda mne ing'anda ya Simoni. Mai wake mwehe wa Simoni yang'ali yoghula homa kali ng'ani, wamlomba Yesu amuhonetse mai ayo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Apfo kaghenda kema habehi na mai ayo, kaukembela utamu. Nawo utamu umlawa, bahala kenuka, kandusa kuwatumikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Litsuwa haling'ali lyotsama, iwanu wamghalila Yesu iwanu iwang'ali woghula chila utamu, naye keka ghamoko ghake mwa chila mtamu, kawahonetsa wose. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ipfinyamkela tsawawalawa iwanu wengi na kudama, “Ghweghwe kwe Imwana wa Imulungu!” Yesu kawakembela na kuwaghoma kulonga, kwaapfila tsawammanya yeye kakala Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu mne ing'anda ye ukulombela</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:35-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lupfilipfili Yesu kaghenda kunze kwe ghumji hanu halihela imunu. Iwanu wandusa kumbama, na hawamwonile wabama kumghoma aleke kuka. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lekeni kawalongela, “Pfipfila nobamighwa kuwapetela iwanu Mbuli Inoghile ye Undewa we Imulungu kune imiji ingi, kwaapfila acho chicho Imulungu chanitumile kuchitenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Apfo kaghendelela ukuwapetela iwanu mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela mne isi yose ya Yudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema iwatumighwa wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:18-22; Maliki 1:16-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu tsakema mmbalimbali mwa tsiwa Genesareti, baho iwanu wammemela na kumkunughitsa kunughitsa, wategheletsa Imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kayona minumbwi mili mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ilekighwe na iwalowa somba iwang'ali wohopfugha nyapfu tsao. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi ghumwe ghwa Simoni, kamlongela aghusoghetse mnumbwi chidogho kulawa mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu mbaka mne ghamatsi. Kuya kakala hasi na kalangulitsa mtingano ghwe iwanu aku kamne mnumbwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hayamalitse kulonga, kamlongela Simoni, “Usoghetse mnumbwi ghupfike haghatighati, kuya utsase nyapfu tsako mne ghamatsi upfule iwasomba.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Imtwatsa! Tusang'ana ichilo chose ng'atupatile ichinu bae. Lekeni kwaapfila kulonga apfo, notsasa!” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Watsasa nyapfu tsao na wapfula iwasomba wengi ng'ani mbaka nyapfu tsao tsandusa kudegheka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo wawabengutsa wayawo iwakalile mne mnumbwi ghungi watse wawapfile. Wapfika, waweka iwasomba mne minumbwi yose mili mbaka ibama kutsama. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri hayonile achila ichilawile, kamtowela Yesu maghoti kalonga, “Ughende Imtwatsa! Nene ne imunu yane nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni na weyaghe wakangawala kwe iwasomba wengi wawalowile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pfipfila weyaghe Simoni, Jakobu na Yohane, iwanaghe Sebedayo nawo wakangawala. Yesu kamlongela Simoni, “Uleke kupfuka, kulawa sambi na kughendelela kutsowapfula iwanu.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Waikwegha minumbwi yawo mbaka mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, waleka chila ichinu, wamuwinza Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:1-4; Maliki 1:40-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali mne ghumji ghumwe, tsakatsa imunu yane ukoma lukuli lwose. Imtamu ayo hamwonile Yesu, keghwisa hasi, kalomba “Imtwatsa, ka kwobama, kwodaha kunitenda nihone!”<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="fk">Nideghete </char> Ukoma ukali utamu iwotenda imunu aleke kumlomba Imulungu, kwaapfila tsakoneka keha hambele he Imulungu. </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kagholosa ghumoko, kamkinda, kalonga, “Nobama; Uhone!” Bahala ukoma umlawa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose. Lekeni ughende, wilanguse kwe imbala we inambiko ne ulapfe inambiko ka Musa pfawalongele, iwanu wose wamanye ka ghweghwe kuhona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni mbuli tsa Yesu tsongetseka kwenela mne isi yose, na iwanu wengi wapfika kumtegheletsa na wambama awahonetse utamu wawo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu tsakaghenda hanu halihela imunu, ako kalomba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:1-8; Maliki 2:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu yang'ali yolangulitsa. Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso iwalawile mne imiji ya Galilaya, Yudeya na Yerusalemu tsawakala bahala. Ngupfu ye Imtwatsa tsaikala naye kwa kuwahonetsa iwatamu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wapfika, wamduta machela mne lutsatsi imunu yaholole, wabama wamghale mng'anda, hambele ha Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awadahile bae, kwaapfila tsahana iwanu wengi sideke. Apfo wamghala, wamwika mchiswili, wafumla kuya wahulumsa machela mbaka haghatighati he iwanu awo, hayali Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Iwanu wane womuhulumsa imunu kulawa mchiswili</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu honile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu yaholole, “Sale yangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo wandusa kwighutsa, “Ayuno imunu wachi iyomligha Imulungu? Yuhi iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi? Angu si Imulungu yaliyeka iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, kawaghutsa, “Mkwalangula choni mne imimoyo yenu? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chihi chibewe; kulonga ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa’ au kulonga ‘Winuke ughende?’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nobama mmanye, Imwana we Imunu kana uwetso wa kuleghusa nzambi mne iisi.” Apfo kamlongela imunu yaholole, “Nokulongela, winuke usole chilagho chako uye ukaye!” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bahala imunu ayo kenuka hambele hawo, kasola chilagho chake. Koka ukaye yake aku komtunya Imulungu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wakangawala ghendo! Wapfuka na wamtunya Imulungu, walonga, “Leloli tupfona ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:9-13; Maliki 2:13-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Haghamalile agho, Yesu kalawa kunze kamwona imunu iyosola kodi yakemighwe Lawi kakala mne ing'anda ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamlongela, “Uniwinze.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lawi kenuka, kaleka chila chinu kamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya Lawi kamtendela Yesu chihungo chikulu mne ing'anda yake, na kingili kulu lye iwanu iwasola kodi ne iwanu wangi tsawabahala. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wangi iwalawile mne kingili lyawo wawanung'unikila iwanang'ina wa Yesu, “Ebali mwakuja na kunwa hamwe ne iwanu iwasola kodi na wane nzambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Iwanu iwaghima ng'awombama bae imghanga, ila awala iwatamu iwo iwombama imghanga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Sitsile bae kuwakema iwanu iwanoghile, ila wane nzambi wadahe kutsileka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya kufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:14-17; Maliki 2:18-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wamlongela Yesu, “Iwanang'ina wa Yohane wafungagha ukuja na kulomba, na iwatumighwa wa Mafarisayo wotenda pfipfo. Lekeni iwanang'ina wako wakuja na kunwa!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Apfi mwodaha kuwaghoma iwanu iwakemighwe kune chihungo cha kukwela waleke ukuja ahala imunu yokwela ang'ali nawo? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lekeni litsuwa lyakutsa imunu yokwela hatsosolighwa kulawa mna wawo, na baho watsofunga ukuja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Kuduhu imunu iyodegha ichiraka kulawa mne lighwanda lya sambi na kuchika mne lighwanda lya ghumwande. Ka kotenda apfo, katsolidegha lighwanda lya sambi, na ichiraka kulawa mne lighwanda lya sambi ng'achitsolingana bae na lighwanda lya ghumwande. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Na kuduhu imunu iyoghuma dipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ye ingotsi ya ghumwande. Kwaapfila ka kotenda apfo, dipfai ya sambi itsoitula imikoba hayo, dipfai itsakwitika na imikoba itsohinyika. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lekeni dipfai ya sambi yobamighwa ighumighwe mne imikoba ya sambi! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyakunwa dipfai ya ghumwande na kuya abame dipfai ya sambi, kwaapfila kolonga, ‘Ya ghumwande inogha.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:1-8; Maliki 2:23-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe lya sabato Yesu ang'ali yobita mne imighunda ya uhemba. Iwanang'ina wake wandusa kukwanyula mikungwi ya uhemba, waifighisa mne ghamoko ghawo waja. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi waghutsa, “Ebali mwotenda ichinu ichighomighwe mne litsuwa lya Sabato?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'amsomile bae achila chatendile Daudi na wayaghe hawakalile ne inzala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daudi tsakengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kasola pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu kapfija. Pfipfila kaweng'a wayaghe. Ghamalaghitso ghomghoma imunu wowose kupfija pfighate apfo, ila ipfilongotsi we inambiko waliyeka iwabamighwe kupfija.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Imwana we Imunu kana ukulu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu yane ghumoko ghuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:9-14; Maliki 3:1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mne Litsuwa lingi lya Sabato, Yesu tsakaghenda kulangulitsa mne ing'anda ya ukulombela. Mne ing'anda ila ye ukulombela tsakukala ne imunu yaholole ghumoko ghwa ukujila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wangi na Mafarisayo tsawabama imbuli ya kumghoghela Yesu. Apfo wamlolesa ka ang'amuhonetse imunu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, kamlongela imunu ayo yaholole ghumoko, “Utse wime hano.” Imunu ayo kenuka, kema hala. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Nowaghutseni mwemwe, apfi mna Litsuwa lya Sabato pfinogha kutenda ghanoghile au kutenda ghehile? Kuukombola ughima we imunu au kuukoma?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kawalolesa iwanu wose iwali hala, kuya kamlongela imunu ayo, “Ugholose ghumoko ghwako.” Katenda ka Yesu pfamlongele, na ghumoko ghwake ghuhonetsighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wona maya wandusa kwilongela iwenyegho ichinu chachi wamtendele Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowasaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:1-4; Maliki 3:13-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mna matsuwa agho Yesu kagheluka kuchidunda, kakala meso chilo chose komlomba Imulungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nemitondo haipfikile, Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake. Kawasaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli kulawa mumula mne kingili lyawo, kaweng'a taghwa iwatumighwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Simoni, Yesu kamwing'a taghwa lya keli Petiri, na ndughu yake Andereya, Jakobu, Yohane, Filipi, Batalomeyo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Matei na Tomasi na Jakobu imwana we Alifayo na Simoni iyakemighwe Zelote, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yuda imwana wa Jakobu na Yuda Isikarioti, yamhunduke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa na kuwahonetsa iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulumke kuchidunda na iwatumighwa wake, kema mlwanda na kingili kulu lye iwanang'ina wake. Iwanu wengi tsawabahala iwalawile tsiisi tsose tsa Yudeya, Yerusalemu na walawile mne tsiisi tsa kumwani tsa Tiro na Sidoni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu awo watsa kumtegheletsa Yesu na kuhonetsighwa matamu ghawo. Pfipfila iwanu wala iwadununzighwe ne ipfinyamkela watsa wahonetsighwa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iwanu wose tsawabama kumkinda Yesu, kwaapfila ingupfu ing'ali imlawa na iwahonetsa wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukudeng'a na usungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 5:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola iwanang'ina wake kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mbweda mwemwe wahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila Undewa we Imulungu iwo wenu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mbweda mwemwe yamne nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila mwitseghuta!</para>
  <para style="q">Mbweda mwemwe yamlila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila mtsosekelela!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mbweda ka iwanu watsowahila,</para>
  <para style="q">watsowabaghula na watsowaligha na watsolonga mwemwe mwiha, kwaajili ye Imwana we Imunu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Deng'eleleni na kubigha agho haghotsolawila</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila ghweko lyenu kulu likighwa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q">Apfo pfipfo iwabala wawo pfawawatendele manabii.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni mtsoghaya mwemwe matajili,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila mwemwe ma tsambokela ughima unoghile!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamwighutile sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila hambele mtsakona inzala!</para>
  <para style="q">Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamsekelela sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila hambele mtsoghanzika no kulila!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mtsoghaya ka iwanu wose</para>
  <para style="q">watsowatogholani mwemwe!</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaapfila apfo pfipfo iwabala wawo pfawawatendele</para>
  <para style="q">manabii wa ughutsu.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwanoghela iwowehila</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 5:38-48; 7:12a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Lekeni nowalongela mwemwe yamnihulika, muwanoghele iwehile wenu, muwatendele ghanoghile iwanu wala iwowehila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muwabaliki iwanu wala iwowalighita, na muwalombele kwe Imulungu iwanu wala iwowatendela ghehile. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ka imunu wowose kakutowa mna likanza limwe, pfipfila mleke akutowe likanza liyaghe, ka imunu kolisola likoti lyako, pfipfila mleke asole lighwanda lyako. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mwing'eni chila imunu cholomba, ka imunu wowose kakuboka ichinu chako, uleke kumlongela akuyitsile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Muwatendele iwanu wangi achila chambama mwemwe wawatendele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mng'awanoghela iwanu wala iwomnoghelani mwemwe, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Hata ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ pfipfila wowanoghela iwanu wala iwowanoghela! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mng'awatendela ghanoghile iwanu wala iwowatendela ghanoghile, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Pfipfila ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ wotenda pfipfo! <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mng'awakopesha iwanu wala yamuwalolela watsomuyitsilani, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Pfipfila ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ wowakopesha wayawo, na kuwalolela wawoyitsile. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lekeni wanogheleni iwowahila mwemwe na muwatendele ghanoghile, muwakopeshe iwanu na mleke kulolela ka watsowoyitsila. Kuya ghweko lyenu litsakuwa kulu, na mtsakuwa iwana we Imulungu iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani. Kwaapfila yeye kanogha kwe iwanu yang'awolonga mighede ne iwanu wehile. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muwe na libatsi, ka Aba wenu pfali na libatsi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwahigha iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 7:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mleke kuwahigha wayenu, ne Imulungu ng'atsowahighani bae. Mleke kuwadununza wayenu, ne Imulungu ng'atsowadununzani bae. Muwalekele wayenu, ne Imulungu katsowalekeleni. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muweng'e iwanu wangi, ne Imulungu katsomwing'ani. Namwe mtsobokela ichipimo chimemile mbaka chakwitika. Kwaapfila ichipimo chamtumila kwe iwanu wangi, Imulungu katsochitumila chicho kuna mwemwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Imunu chifita ng'odaha bae kumlongotsa chifita miyaghe, ka katsotenda apfo, wose weli watsakughwila mwikolongo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuduhu mwanang'ina mkulu kubita mlangulitsi wake. Lekeni chila mwanang'ina iyamalitse ghamalangulitso ghake, kakuwa ka imlangulitsi wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ebali kwochona chibanzi ichili mnenge mwa miyagho, lekeni ng'aulyona bae biki ili mnenge mwako? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Apfi kwodaha kumlongela ndughu yako, ‘Ndughu yangu, leka nikulapfe chibanzi chili mnenge mwako,’ naghwe ghumwenyegho ng'ulyona bae biki ilili mnenge mwako? Ghweghwe kwa mng'enye! Tanu ulilapfe libiki lili mnenge mwako, kuya kutsolola ghoya na kuchilapfa chibanzi chili mnenge mwa ndughu yako.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 7:16-20; 12:33-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mbiki ghunoghile ng'aghukweleka bae ghamatunda ghehile, pfipfila kuduhu mbiki ghuhile ighwukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Chila mbiki ghwomanyika kwa ghamatunda ighukweleka, iwanu ng'awobawa bae mapela mne tsimiwa au ukubawa fifi mne miyonga. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Imunu yanoghile kolapfa ipfinu pfinoghile kulawa hanu hanoghile ipfikighwe mne ghumoyo ghwake, imunu yehile kolapfa ipfinu pfihile kulawa hanu hehile ipfikighwe mne ghumoyo ghwake. Kwaapfila imunu kolonga achila ichimemile mne ghumoyo ghwake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu weli iwotsenga ing'anda</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 7:24-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Ebali mwonikema ‘Mtwatsa, Mtwatsa’ aku ng'amtenda bae achila chaniwalongele mchitende? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nitsowalangusa kakonekatse imunu wowose yula iyonitsila nene na kutsitegheletsa mbuli tsangu na kutenda ka pfobamighwa. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayu keghala ne imunu yatsengile ing'anda kwa kuhimba ng'ani mne libambalawe, na kutsenga ing'anda ayo mchanya mwake. Imvula ng'ulu haitowile ghamatsi ng'aghadahile bae kuyughitsa ing'anda, kwaapfila itsengighwa ghoya. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu iyotegheletsa mbuli tsangu na ng'otenda ka pfobamighwa, ayu keghala ne imunu yatsengile ing'anda mne msanga, bila ukuhimba ng'ani. Imvula ng'ulu haitowile, ghamatsi ghayughitsa ing'anda na kuighwisa, ne ing'anda yose ibomoka.”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imtumwa we imkulu wa asikali wa Roma</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:5-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga ipfinu pfino kwe iwanu, kaghenda Kaperinaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ako tsakukala ne imkulu yumwe we asikali miya imwe wa Roma, naye kakala ne imtumwa wake iyamnoghele ng'ani. Na imtumwa ayo ang'ali yoghula chidogho yafe.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Imkulu wa asikali miya imwe wa Roma,</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imkulu ayo hayahulike mbuli tsa Yesu, kawatuma iwabala wangi wa Wayahudi wamlombe Yesu atse amhonetse imtumwa wake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamghendela Yesu, wamlomba ng'ani, walonga, “Umwapfile imunu yuno, <verse number="5" style="v"/>kwaapfila kowanoghela iwanu wetu, naye iyo iyatutsengele ing'anda ye ukulombela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kaghenda nawo. Hapfikile habehi ne ing'anda ye imkulu ayo, imkulu ayo kawatuma sale tsake wamlongele Yesu, “Imtwatsa, uleke kwitsupfa kutsa kuno. Nene sinoghile bae ghweghwe kwingila mng'anda mwangu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ndo mana tsambona nene sinoghile bae kukutsila ghweghwe. Lekeni ulonge imbuli iliyeka, imtumwa wangu katsohona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nene imwenyegho na imunu yane ukulu, nina asikali iwali hasi hangu. Ning'amlongela yumwe, ‘Ghenda!’ naye koghenda, na ning'amlongela yungi, ‘Itsa!’ naye kakutsa, na ning'amlongela imtumwa wangu, ‘Tenda achino!’ naye kochitenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu hahulike apfo, kakangawala, kawahundukila iwanu iwelongotse naye, kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, sina mbone bae imunu iyotoghola ka imunu yuno, hata mne isi ya Isiraeli!” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wala hawoyile ukaye kwe imkulu wa asikali wa Roma wampfika imtumwa yula kahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komtsilihula imwana we chitsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hambele chidogho, Yesu kaghenda mne ghumji ighukemighwe Naini na iwanang'ina wake, aku kelongotsa na iwanu wengi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya hapfikile habehi na libani kulu lye ghumji, kulawila iwanu waghala lukuli lwa msongolo iyapfile, yeye tsamwana nyalimwe wa ipinga iyali chitsuka. Iwanu wengi iwalawile ghumji ghula tsawakala hamwe na ipinga ayo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imtwatsa hayamwonile ipinga ayo, kamwonela libatsi, kamlongela, “Uleke kulila.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya kaghenda kakinda machela, ne iwanu iwaghalile machela tsawema. Yesu kalonga, “Imsongolo, nokulongela, winuke!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imsongolo yula iyafile kenuka kandusa ukulonga. Kuya Yesu kamwing'a mai we imsongolo yula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wapfuka na wamtunya Imulungu. Walonga, “Nabii mkulu katulawila mghati mwetu. Imulungu katsa kuwapfila iwanu wake.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mbuli atsino tsa Yesu tsenela mne isi yose ya Yudeya na tsiisi tsose itsili habehi.</para>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa kulawa kwe Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 11:2-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wa Yohane wamlongela Yohane agha ghose. Naye kawakema iwanang'ina wake weli <verse number="19" style="v"/>kawatuma waghende kwe Imtwatsa wamghutse, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa yuyula yulongighwe na Yohane katsakutsa au tumbete imunu yungi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hawapfikile kwa Yesu, walonga, “Yohane Mbatitsa katutuma tukughutse, ‘Apfi ghweghwe kwa yuyula yulongighwe na Yohane katsakutsa au tumbete munu yungi?’ ” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ichipindi chichila, Yesu kawahonetsa iwatamu wengi ng'ani, kawalapfa ipfinyamkela na kawatenda ipfifita wengi wone. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika iwanang'ina wa Yohane, “Mghende mkamlongele Yohane aghala ghamwonile na kughahulika; ipfifita sambi wakwona, ipfimbete woghenda, wane ukoma wohona, ipfitsiwi wohulika, iwanu iwafile wotsilihulighwa na mbuli tsinoghile tsopetighwa kwe wahingwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kabweda imunu yula yang'onyihila nene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hambele iwasenga wa Yohane hawokile, Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanu mbuli tsa Yohane, “Hamghendile kunyika, apfi mghendile kulola choni? Kululola lusinde ppfaluyughisighwa na libeho? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfi tsamghendile kulola choni? Imunu yapfalile lighwanda linoghile? Iwanu iwopfala ghamaghwanda ghanoghile na wane ughima unoghile wokala mne tsing'anda tse iwandewa! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mnongele, apfi tsamghendile kulola choni? Nabii? Ona, lekeni tsamwona pfinu pfingi kubita nabii. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yohane iyo yuyo iyandikighwe mna Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, ‘Imulungu tsakalonga, nitsomtuma imtumighwa wangu akulongole, katsoigholosa nzila yako.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Yohane kambala kubita imunu wowose, lekeni imunu wowose yali mdodo mne Undewa wa Imulungu kambala kumbita Yohane.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu wose, na iwasola kodi, hawahulike agho wamtoghola Imulungu, kwaapfila tsawabatitsighwa na Yohane. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso tsawalema aghala ghayawalaghitse Imulungu watende, kwaapfila ng'awabatitsighwe na Yohane bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi iwanu wa mweleko ghuno weghala ne chinu chachi? Weghala na choni? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Weghala ne iwana iwakalile kusoko. Wekema wenyegho kwa wenyegho, ‘Tuwatowela chimbeta, ng'ampfinile bae, tuwembila uwila we usungu, ng'amlilile bae!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yohane Mbatitsa tsakatsa, ng'ajile bae ichijo na ng'anwile bae imbwali, mwemwe mlonga, ‘Yohane kana chinyamkela!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Imwana we imunu katsa, kakuja na kakunwa, namwe mlonga, ‘Imunu yuno kakujisa na kopatika sideke, sale wa iwasola kodi na wane nzambi!’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lekeni ihekima yoneka inogha kwe iwanu wose yawaitoghole.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ipinga yane nzambi kombaka ghamafuta Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mfarisayo yumwe tsakamkema Yesu atse kuja naye ichijo cha nemihe. Yesu kaghenda mne ing'anda ya Mfarisayo ayo, kakala hasi yaje ichijo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mne ghumji ghula, tsakukala ne ipinga yane nzambi. Hayahulike Yesu kakuja mne ing'anda ya Mfarisayo ayo, ipinga ayo katsa na ichupa inoghile imemile ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kema habehi na ghamaghulu gha Yesu, kolila na ghamasotsi ghake ghamlaghalila Yesu. Kuya kabaghusa ghamaghulu gha Yesu kwa tsimvili tsake, kaghanonela na kabaka ghamafuta aghala, mmaghulu mwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mfarisayo ayo honile pfino, kelongela imwenyegho, “Imunu yuno ang'awile nabii, ang'amtangile ipinga yuno iyamkindile ka imunu wachi, ang'ammanyile kana nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Simoni, nina chinu nobama nikulongele” Simoni kedika, “Ona mlangulitsi, nongele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kandusa kulonga, “Tsahana wanu weli iwatsime sendi kwe imunu iyakwatsima iwanu tsisendi. Yumwe katsima elufu tano na yungi katsima hamsini. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mna wose weli, kuduhu yalihile sendi, apfo imunu iyakwatsima wanu tsisendi kawalekela wose. Apfi mne wano weli yuhi yatsomnoghela ng'ani imunu iyakwatsima iwanu tsisendi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Nopfikitsa imunu yula yalekelighwe tsisendi nyingi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kalonga, “Kulonga ghoya.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamhundukila ipinga ayo, kamlongela Simoni, “Apfi kwomwona ipinga hayu? Nitsa mng'anda mwako, ng'ungaile bae ghamatsi gha kuhopfugha ghamaghulu ghangu, lekeni ipinga ayu kahopfugha ghamaghulu ghangu kwa ghamasotsi ghake na kaghabaghusa kwa tsimvili tsake. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ng'uninonele bae, lekeni kulawa hayengile ipinga ayu kaghendelela kughanonela ghamaghulu ghangu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ng'ubakile bae litwi lyangu ghamafuta, lekeni ipinga ayu kaghabakatsa ghamaghulu ghangu kwa ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nokulongela, kwaapfila nzambi tsake nyingi tsileghusighwa, apfo kaninoghela ng'ani. Lekeni imunu yalekelighwe chidogho konoghela chidogho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela ipinga ayo, “Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi iwakalile hala wandusa kwilongela, “Ayu imunu wachi mbaka yaleghuse nzambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela ipinga hayo, “Ukutoghola kwako kukukombola. Ughende tseghamba.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwapinga iwelongotse na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Matsuwa ghaghala, Yesu tsakanga mne tsikaye na mna imiji, kuno kowapetela iwanu imbuli inoghile ye undewa we Imulungu. Na wala Iwanang'ina kumi na weli waghenda na Yesu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>naye tsakelongotsa ne iwapinga wangi iwalapfighwe ipfinyamkela na kuhonetsighwa matamu. Iwapinga awo tsawakala Mariya iyakemighwe Magidalena, yalapfighwe ipfinyamkela saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na Yoana, mwehe wake Kusa, imkulu mne libaratsa lya Herodi, na Susana, na iwapinga wangi wengi. Wawo tsawalapfa pfinu pfawo wamwapfile Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:1-9; Maliki 4:1-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanu wamghendela Yesu kulawa chila kaye, iwanu hawatingane hamwe, Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Imunu tsakaghenda kuhanda tsimbeghu. Hang'ali yomitsa tsimbeghu mne mghunda, tsingi tsilaghalila mnzila. Iwanu watsibayugha na pfideghe watsija. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo lili mbambalawe, hatsotile, tsinyala kwaapfila tsakuduhu ghamatsi mne lidongo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tsingi tsilaghalila mwibagho, tsikula hamwe, na libagho litsikoma tsimbeghu hatso. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo linoghile, tsikula na kweleka imitama, chila imwe ghana limwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu hayalongile apfi, kakemelela, “Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa Yesu imbuli ino ina mana yachi? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mtendighwa mmanye mbuli tse undewa we Imulungu. Lekeni kwe iwanu wangi, nolonga kwe tsimbuli, walole lekeni waleke kwona, wategheletse lekeni waleke kumanya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela imbuli ye imunu iyohanda ilonga choni</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:18-23; Maliki 4:13-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Aino mana ye imbuli ino. Mbeghu yolangusa imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mnzila tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, lekeni Setani kakutsa na kuisola imbuli kulawa mne imimoyo yawo, ili waleke kutoghola na kukombolighwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo lili mbambalawe tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu na kuibokela kwa kudeng'elela, lekeni ng'aitsama bae mghati mwe imimoyo yawo. Woitoghola kwe ichipindi chidodo, lekeni mne ichipindi cha kughetsighwa na Setani, webaghula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mwibagho tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu lekeni pfawoghendelela, imbuli ye Imulungu yohinyighwa na maghayo, ndeng'elelo, na tsimali tse isi. Iwanu awo ng'awokweleka ghamatunda ghakomale bae. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo linoghile tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woibokela na woitoghola kwe imimoyo yawo na wodudumila mbaka wokweleka ghamatunda.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ichitasa ichighubikighwe ne chiha</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:21-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Iwanu ng'awotuwitsa bae ichitasa na kuchighubika na chiha au kuchika kumpfungu mwe lutsatsi. Lekeni iwanu wochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa ili iwanu iwakwingila wadahe kughona ghumwanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ichinu chochose ichipfisighwe chitsakuwa mwatsi, na ichinu chochose ichighubikighwe chitsomanyika na kughalighwa mne ghumwanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Apfo mwalangitse pfamuhulikitsa, kwaapfila imunu yenacho katsakongetsighwa, ne imunu yalihela ichinu katsobokighwa hata achila chopfikitsa kenacho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mai wake Yesu na ndughu tsake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:46-50; Maliki 3:31-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mai wake ne iwandughu tsake Yesu wamtsila, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kupfika habehi naye, kwaapfila iwanu tsawengi sideke. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe kamlongela Yesu, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wema kunze, wobama wakwone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Mai wangu na ndughu tsangu, iwo wala iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu na kuitoghola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu inyamale</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 8:22-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi ne iwanang'ina wake, kawalongela, “Tuloke kumwambu mwe tsimbu.” Apfo wandusa ghumwanza. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hawang'ali mne ghumwanza, Yesu kawasa. Bahala, nyahemu ng'ulu ng'ani tsailawila mne tsimbu na mnumbwi wandusa kumema ghamatsi, apfo wose tsawabama watsame. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlamsa, “Mtwatsa, Mtwatsa! Twotsama!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kalamka, kalikembela libeho ne inyahemu, napfo pfinyamala. Litsimbu linyamala tulu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Kulikwani ukutoghola kwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni wakangawala, wapfuka, welongela, “Ayu imunu wachi? Kokembela libeho ne inyahemu, napfo pfomhulikitsa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yane pfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:28-34; Maliki 5:1-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghendelela na ghumwanza, wapfika mne isi ya Gerasi, ili kumwambu mwe tsimbu Galilaya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yohulumka mne mnumbwi, kaghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ketingana ne imunu yane ipfinyamkela. Imunu ayo ng'apfalile bae ghamaghwanda kwa ghamatsuwa mengi, na ng'akalile bae mng'anda, lekeni ang'ali yokala kune tsikaburi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hamwonile Yesu, tsakalila na kamghwila mmaghulu, kuya kakemela, “Yesu, Imwana we Imulungu Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani! Apfi kwobama unitende choni? Nokulomba uleke kunidununza!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Imunu yuno kalonga apfino kwaapfila Yesu tsakawakembela ipfinyamkela wamlawe. Chinyamkela ayo ang'ali yomghoghagha. Hata ka iwanu tsawamwoha ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake ne minyololo, yeye kaibema minyololo ayo, na ipfinyamkela wamghalagha mbaka kunyika. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Taghwa lyako nani?” Naye kamwidika, “Taghwa lyangu ‘Likingili’,” kwaapfila tsakana ipfinyamkela wengi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ipfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu aleke kuwaghala mne lipondo lyang'alitsigha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Habehi na hanu hala tsahana kingili lye iwangubi iwang'ali wakuja mlughongo. Apfo pfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu awalekelele wawengile iwangubi awo, naye Yesu kawaleka wawengile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ipfinyamkela wamlawa imunu ayo wengila mne iwangubi. Likingili lyose lye iwangubi litsumila kulwanda mwe tsimbu Galilaya, wafa mne ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wadimi we iwangubi hawonile achila ichilawile, watsuma na kutsilonga mbuli atso mne ghumji na mne ipfijiji. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iwanu waghenda kulola achila ichilawile, hawapfikile kwa Yesu, wampfika imunu yahonetsighwe ipfinyamkela kakala mmaghulu mwa Yesu, kapfala ghamaghwanda, na tsimbutsi tsake tsimuyila keli. Iwanu wose tsawapfuka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Iwanu wala iwonile chinu chino wawalongela iwanu apfila imunu yane ipfinyamkela pfayahonetsighwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wose we isi ya Gerasi wamlomba Yesu yoke kwaapfila tsawapfuka ghendo. Apfo Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi yoke. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imunu yahonetsighwe ipfinyamkela kamlomba Yesu, “Leka nighende na ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni Yesu ng'atoghole bae kughenda naye, kamlongela, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Uye ukaye ukawalongele iwanu achila chayakutendele Imulungu.” Apfo kaghenda muisi mwose, kawalongela iwanu achila Yesu chayamtendele.</para>
  <para style="s">Neghe Yairo ne ipinga iyakindile ghwanda lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:18-26; Maliki 5:21-43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu hayoile ubali ungi wa tsimbu, iwanu wambokela kwa kudeng'elela kwaapfila wose tsawang'ali wombeta. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuya katsa imunu yumwe yakemighwe Yairo, iyakalile mkulu we Ing'anda ya ukulombela. Keghwisa mmaghulu mwa Yesu, kamlomba aghende ukaye yake, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kwaapfila imwanaghe ipinga nyalimwe yane miyaka kumi na mili yang'ali yobama yafe.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda, iwanu wammemela chila hanu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pinga yumwe yadununzike kwa utamu wa kulawa idamu kwa miyaka kumi na mili, hata ka tsakaghisa mali tsake tsose kwa waghanga, tsakuduhu imunu yadahile kumhonetsa, tsakakala mne iwanu awo. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pinga ayo tsakatsa kuchisogho kwa Yesu kakinda pindo lya ghwanda lyake. Bahala idamu ileka kumlawa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kaghutsa, “Angu yuhi yanikindile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanu wose wabela. Petiri kalonga, “Imtwatsa, iwanu wakutsunguluka na wakumemela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kalonga, “Kuna imunu kang'inda, nimanya kwaapfila ngupfu tsangu tsindawa.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ipinga hayonile ng'odaha bae kwipfisa, tsakatsa aku koghudema, keghwisa mmaghulu mwa Yesu. Kamlongela Yesu hambele he iwanu iwali hala ichinu ichimtendile amkinde na bahala pfayahonetsighwe. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela ipinga ayo, “Mwanangu, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa. Ughende tseghamba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali yolonga, tsakatsa imunu kulawa mne ing'anda ya Yairo. Kamlongela Yairo, “Uleke kumtsupfa Imlangulitsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu haulike apfo kamlongela Yairo, “Uleke kupfuka, ghwe toghola na imwanagho katsohonetsighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Hapfikile ukaye kwa Yairo, kawaghoma iwanu waleke kwingila naye mng'anda, lekeni Petiri, Yohane, Jakobu, aba wa imwana yula iyafile na mai wake. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wanu wose wang'ali womlila imwana iyafile akuno weyayana. Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kulila, imwana ng'afile bae, ila kawasa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wamseka Yesu kwaapfila tsawamanya imwana kafa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kaghukinda ghumoko ghwe imwana iyafile, kamlongela, “Mwanangu, lamka!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Imwana iyafile ughima wake umuyila, na bahala kalamka. Kuya Yesu kawalongela wamwing'e imwana yula ichijo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Aba wake na mai wake tsawakangawala, lekeni Yesu kawaghoma kumlongela imunu wowose achila ichilawile.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu tsakawakema hamwe iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kaweng'a ingupfu na uwetso wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela na kuhonetsa watamu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuya kawatuma kuwapetela iwanu mbuli tsa Undewa we Imulungu na kuwahonetsa iwatamu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Mne ghumwanza mleke kusola ichinu chochose, mleke kusola ng'weku wala ghumkoba wala ichijo wala sendi wala maghwanda meli. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ing'anda yoyose yamkwingila, mkale mmo mbaka hamkuka mne ghumji aghwo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iwanu wang'alema kuwabokela, hamlawa mne ghumji aghwo, mkung'use litimbwisi mmaghulu mwenu, chiwe ichitango ka walema kumuhulikitsani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake waghenda mne ipfijiji pfose, aku wopeta Imbuli Inoghile na wowahonetsa iwanu chila hanu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imndewa Herodi kompfuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:1-12; Maliki 6:14-29)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Herodi hakalile mndewa wa Galilaya, kahulika ipfinu pfose ipfitendighwe na Yesu. Naye kapfuka kwaapfila iwanu wangi tsawang'ali wolonga Yohane mbatitsa katsilihuka, <verse number="8" style="v"/>wangi walonga Eliya kalawila, na wangi walonga nabii yumwe wa ghumwande katsilihuka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Herodi kalonga, “Yohane tsanimghana litwi, apfi ayu nani iyanihulika mbuli tsake?” Naye tsakabama amwone.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:13-21; Maliki 6:30-44; Yohane 6:1-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwatumighwa wake hawoyile wamlongela Yesu chila ichinu chawatendile. Naye kawasola iwanang'ina wake waliyeka, kaghenda nawo mne ghumji ighukemighwe Betisaida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iwanu hawamanyile kwaghendile, tsawamuwinza. Yesu kawabokela, kalonga nawo mbuli tse Undewa we Imulungu na kawahonetsa iwanu iwabamile kuhonetsighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Litsua haling'ali lyikuswa, iwanang'ina kumi na weli wamghendela Yesu wamlongela, “Walongele iwanu waghende mne ipfijiji na kaye itsili mne imighunda tsa habehi kubama ichijo na hanu ha kuwasa, kwaapfila twakunyika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe iwenyegho muweng'e ichijo waje.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Twetwe tuna pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli waliheka. Pfii kwobama tughende tukawaghulile iwanu wose wano?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hanu hala hana wamale elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Muwalongele iwanu wakale mne makingili, na chila kingili wanu hamsini.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina watenda apfo, iwanu wose wakala hasi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kasola pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki. Kuya kamegha pfighate ne iwasomba, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwanu wose tsawaja weghuta. Ne iwanang'ina wadondola pfihindi pfe pfighate ne iwasomba ipfimemile Pfiseghe kumi na pfili.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kotoghola kwa kulonga ka Yesu ka Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 9:18-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu ang'ali yolomba aliyeka. Iwanang'ina wake wamtsila, naye kawaghutsa, “Apfi iwanu wolonga nene nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nawo wamwidika, “Iwanu wamwenga wolonga ghweghwe kwa Yohane Mbatitsa, wangi wolonga kwa Eliya, wangi wolonga kwa-yumwe wa manabii wa ghumwande yoyile mne ughima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Naye kawaghutsa, “Namwe mwolonga nene nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu yulawile kwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawakanya waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ichinu chino.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga pfatsodununzika na pfatsakufa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 16:20-28; Maliki 8:30-9:1)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pfipfila tsakawalongela, “Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yadununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwabala, ipfilongotsi we inambiko ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Katsokomighwa, kuya mne litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela wose, “Imunu wowose iyobama kuniwinza nene yeleme imwenyegho na yaghale msalaba ghwake, aniwinze. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake katsowaghitsa, lekeni wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake kwa kuniwinza nene katsoukombola. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfi imunu yobweda choni ka ang'apata chila chinu ichili muisi mwose, aku kowaghisa ughima wake? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyombonela chinyala nene na ghamalangulitso ghangu, Imwana we Imunu katsomwonela chinyala hatsakutsa mne utunitso wake, na mne utunitso wa aba wake, na we malaika wahenzeluka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, wangi iwemile hano ng'awatsakufa bae mbaka wawone Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalamka uhanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:1-8; Maliki 9:2-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Aghabitile matsuwa manane kulawa halongile ipfinu pfino, Yesu kawasola Petiri, Yohane, na Jakobu, wagheluka kuchidunda kulomba. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali yolomba, uhanga wake ughalamka na ghwanda lyake liwa tselu chwee. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahala iwanu weli wang'ali wolonga naye. Iwanu awo tsawakala Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>woneka mne utunitso wa kulanga na walonga na Yesu mbuli tsa lifwa lyake ilitsolawila Yerusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Petiri na wayaghe tsawawasa ghendo, na hawalamke wona utunitso wa Yesu ne iwanu weli wema naye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwanu awo hawang'ali wakuka, Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Mtwatsa, pfinogha twetwe tukale hano. Leka tutsenge pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe chako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” Petiri ng'amanyile bae yang'ali yolonga choni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petiri hang'ali yolonga apfo, liwingu lilawila liwaghubika, ne iwanang'ina wapfuka liwingu pfaliwaghubike. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Litsi lilonga kulawa mne liwingu, “Ayuno mwanangu yanimsaghule, mtegheletseni yeye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Litsi halinyamale, Yesu tsakakala aliyeka. Iwanang'ina wenyamala na ng'awamlongele imunu wowose bae ichinu chawonile ghamatsuwa agho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo yane ipfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:14-18; Maliki 9:14-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Haipfikile nemitondo, Yesu na iwanang'ina wadatu wahulumka kuchidunda, na iwanu wengi wetingana naye. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe iyakalile mna mtingano ghula ghwe iwanu kakemelela, “Mlangulitsi! Nokulomba umlole imwanangu, imwanangu nyalimwe! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ichinyamkela komghogha na komtenda adamilile, komtenda yaghwe chisala na lihofu lomlawa mne mlomo, na ng'omlekelela bae himahima! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Niwalomba iwanang'ina wako wamlapfe ichinyamkela, lekeni ng'awadahile bae.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ka! Pfii mwemwe mweleko ing'aghutoghola na iwaghile! Apfi ng'ale namwe na kuwadudumila mbaka tsuwachi?” Kuya kamlongela imunu ayo, “Nighalile hano imwanagho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Imsongolo hang'ali yomghendela Yesu, ichinyamkela kamghwisa hasi chisala. Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, kamhonetsa imsongolo ayo na kamuhitsa imsongolo ayo kwa aba wake. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wakangawala kwa uwetso mkulu we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga keli lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:22-23; Maliki 9:30-32)</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanu hawang'ali wokangawala kwa ghose ghayatendile Yesu, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mleke kwisemwa achino chaniwalongela! Imwana we Imunu katsoghalighwa mna ghamoko ghe iwanu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanang'ina wake ng'awamanyile bae mana ye imbuli ino, kwaapfila ipfisighwa waleke kuimanya; nawo wapfuka kumghutsa Yesu imbuli ino.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi katsokughwa imkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 18:1-5; Maliki 9:33-37)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wa Yesu wandusa kwihisanya yuhi yatsakuwa imkulu mna wawo. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu hamanyile ukwalangula kwawo, kamsola imwana mdodo kamwika habehi naye. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Imunu wowose iyombokela imwana yuno kwa taghwa lyangu kombokela nene. Ne imunu wowose iyombokela nene, pfipfila kombokela iyanitumile. Kwaapfila imunu wowose yali mdodo mna mwemwe katsakughwa mkulu mna mwemwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu wowose iyowatoghola kahamwe namwe</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohane kamlongela Yesu, “Mtwatsa, tumwona imunu kolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa taghwa lyako na tumghoma kutenda apfo, kwaapfila ng'elongotsagha na twetwe bae”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela Yohane ne iwanang'ina wangi, “Mleke kumghoma, kwaapfila imunu wowose iyowatoghola mwemwe kahamwe namwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Samariya wolema kumbokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa gha Yesu gha kuya kulanga aghapfikile habehi, Yesu kabama aghende Yerusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawalongotsa iwatumighwa iwaghendile mne tsikaye tsa Samariya kumwikila ghoya chila ichinu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wa Samariya ng'awambokele bae, kwaapfila tsawamanya koghenda Yerusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake, Jakobu na Yohane hawonile apfo, wamghutsa Yesu, “Mtwatsa, apfi kwobama twetwe tukeme ghumoto ghuhulumke kulawa kulanga ghuwalakatse wose, ka Eliya pfayatendile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu kawahundukila kawakembela.<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.55 </char><char style="fk">Kawakembela </char> Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghangi gha ghumwande ghongetsa <char style="fk">Kawalongela, </char> “Ng'ammanya bae muhe wachi mlinawo; kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu ng'atsile bae kughuhinya ughima wa iwanu, lekeni kuwakombola.” </note> <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda kuna kaye tsingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Iwodaha kumuwinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:19-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Hawang'ali mnzila, imunu yumwe kamlongela Yesu, “Nitsokuwinza hanu hohose utsoghenda.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Wambwa wa kumuhulo wana tsimango ne iwapfideghe wana pfibali, lekeni Imwana we Imunu kahela hanu ha kuwasitsa litwi lyake na kubwihila.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela imunu yungi, “Niwinze!” Lekeni imunu yula kalonga, “Imtwatsa, leka tanu mbuye ukaye nikamtsike aba wangu.” <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Leka iwanu iwafile wawatsike wayawo, ila ghweghwe ghenda upete Undewa we Imulungu.” <verse number="61" style="v"/>Imunu yungi kalonga, “Imtwatsa, nitsokuwinza lekeni leka tanu nikawalongele iwandughu tsangu nakuka.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Imunu wowose iyokwaluka kulima na kuya kolola kuchisogho ng'obamighwa mne Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanu sabini na weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Imtwatsa kawasaghula iwanu wangi sabini na weli na kawatuma weliweli wamlongolele chila kaye na chila hanu abamile kughenda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Ghamapfuno mengi, lekeni iwosang'ana wadodo. Mumlombe Imtwatsa wa ghamahuno awatume watenda isang'ano mne mghunda ghwake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mghende! Nowatuma mwemwe ka iwang'olo mghati mwe wambwa wa kumuhulo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mleke kusola ghumfuko au ghumkoba au imikwabatsa. Na mleke kulamsa imunu wowose mnzila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na ing'anda yoyose yamtsakwingila, tanu mlonge, ‘Mkale tseghamba mne ing'anda ino.’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ka imunu yobama kukala tseghamba kabaho, katsakuwa tseghamba. Ka kuduhu imunu yobama kukala tseghamba, mwemwe mtsokala tseghamba. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mkale mne ing'anda hayo, mje na mnwe chochose chamkwing'ighwa; kwaapfila mtenda isang'ano kobamighwa yeng'ighwe sendi tsake. Mkale mne ing'anda iyampfikile na mleke kulawa mne ing'anda ayo na kughenda ing'anda ingi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ka mwakwingila mne ghumji ne iwanu wowabokela, diyeni achila chamtsakwing'ighwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Muwahonetse iwatamu iwali hao muwalongele, ‘Undewa we Imulungu wa habehi yenu.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni ka mwakwingila mne ghumji ne iwanu wolema kuwabokela, biteni mna nzila tsawo mlonge, <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Hata litimbwisi lya ghumji ghwenu ilinanahile mmaghulu mwetu twowakung'usilani mwemwe, chiwe chitango ka mlighitighwa, Lekeni mmanye pfino, Undewa wa Imulungu wa habehi ghendo’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, mne litsuwa lya kuhigha Imulungu katsoghuhigha ng'ani ghumji agho kubita ghumji ghwa Sodoma!”</para>
  <para style="s">Imiji iilema kutoghola itsoghaya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 11:20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ghweghwe Kolasini kutsoghaya! Ghweghwe Betisaida kutsoghaya! Kwaapfila ka ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa ipfitendeke hano pfing'atendeke Tiro na Sidoni, iwanu iwali hala wang'apfalile maghwanda gha ghamaghuniya na wang'abakale lipfu kulangusa waleka nzambi tsawo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha Imulungu katsoyonela libatsi imiji ya Tiro na Sidoni kubita mwemwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Naghwe Kaperinaumu! Apfi kutsakwinulighwa mbaka kulanga? Bae! Kutsakwasighwa mbaka kutsimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Imunu iyowategheletsa mwemwe, konitegheletsa nene; ne imunu iyowalema mwemwe, kondema nene. Ne imunu iyondema nene, komlema yula iyanitumile!”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu sabini na weli wakuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char>
    </note>Hambele iwanu wala sabini na weli woya wodeng'elela ng'ani, walonga, “Mtwatsa, kwa taghwa lyako tuwakembela ipfinyamkela nawo watenda ka pfatubamile kutenda!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nimwona Setani kaghwa ka lumwesa kulawa kulanga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mtegheletse! Niweng'ani ukulu mwemwe, apfo mwodaha kuwabajugha wanzoka ne iwainge; mtsakuwa na ukulu kwa iwehile wenu wose. Kuduhu ichinu chitsowalagha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni mleke kudeng'elela kwaapfila ipfinyamkela wowapfukani, ila mdeng'elele kwaapfila mataghwa ghenu ghandikighwa kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodeng'elela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 11:25-27; 13:16-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isaa iila Yesu kadeng'elela ng'ani na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. Kuya kalonga, “Aba, Imtwatsa wa kulanga ne iisi, nolonga mighede kwaapfila kupfipfisa ipfinu pfino kwe iwanu wane ihekima na iwomanya; na kupfilangusa kwe iwana wadodo! Ona, Aba, apfi pfipfo pfaubamile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kaghendelela kuwalongela iwanu, “Aba wangu kangaya nene ipfinu pfose. Kuduhu imunu iyommanya Imwana ila Aba, na kuduhu imunu iyommanya Aba ila Imwana, ne iwanu wala iwasaghulighwe kulangusighwa ne Imwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawahundukila iwanang'ina wake kalonga nawo waliyeka, “Wabalikiighwa iwanu wala iwakona ipfinu pfamkwona mwemwe! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nowalongela, manabii ne iwandewa wengi tsawabama wone achino chamkona mwemwe, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kwona; na kutegheletsa achino chamtegheletsa, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kutegheletsa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Msamariya yanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mlangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso kema amghetse Yesu, kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, apfi nobamighwa nitende choni ili niubokele ughima wa matsuwa ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Apfi Ghamalaghitso gholongatse? Apfi kwoghamanyatse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Mnoghele Imtwatsa Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose, kwa muhe wako ghwose, kwa ngupfu tsako tsose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose; na mnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kwidika ghoya. Tenda apfo naghwe kutsakuwa na ughima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu ayo kabama kwilangusa kanogha, apfo kamghutsa Yesu, “Yuhi imunu wa habehi yangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Tsahana imunu yumwe yalawile Yerusalemu koghenda Yeriko. Wabapfi wamghogha, wamwibila ipfinu pfake, wamtowa chidogho yafe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Baho kalawila mtambika kohulumka mna inzila iila, lekeni hamwonile imunu yula yatowighwe, kabita mmbalimbali. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pfipfila Mlawi hapfikile na kumwona imunu yatowighwe, naye kabita mmbalimbali. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni Msamariya yumwe ang'ali yobita inzila iila kampfika imunu yula. Hamwonile, kamwonela libatsi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kamghendela, kambakatsa ghamafuta ne idipfai mne ipfilonda pfake kuya kapfoha kwa pfibwende. Kuya kamwika mne ipunda wake, kamghala mne ing'anda ya kuwasa iwahenza, kamng'otsola. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Litsuwa liwinzile Msamariya yula kamwing'a sendi imunu yane ing'anda, kamlongela, ‘Mlolese imunu yuno. Hanikuya, nitsokuyitsila chochose chutumile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Mkwonatse, apfi mne iwanu awo wadatu, yuhi imunu wa habehi ne imunu iyatowighwe na wabapfi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Imlangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso kamwidika, “Imunu yula yamwonele libatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Naghwe ghenda ukatende ka pfatendile Msamariya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda ukaye kwa Marita na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali woghenda, kengila mne ichijiji chimwe. Ipinga yumwe yakemighwe Marita kambokela ukaye yake. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo tsakana ndughu yake iyakemighwe Mariya, iyakalile hasi habehi na ghamaghulu ghe Imtwatsa. Naye ang'ali yotegheletsa malangulitso ghake. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Marita ang'ali yoghaya na tsing'onde nyingi. Apfo, kamghendela Yesu, kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, apfi ng'ukwona bae ndughu yangu kandekela ng'onde tsose nisang'ane nene niliyeka? Mlongele yatse yanyapfile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kamwidika, “Marita! Kwokwalangula no ukughaya kwa ipfinu pfingi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>lekeni ichinu chimwe chiliheka ichibamighwa, na Mariya kasaghula ichinu ichinoghile, na ng'atsobokighwa bae.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalangulitsa kulomba iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 6:9-13; 7:7-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu tsakakala hanu hamwe kolomba. Hayamalitse kulomba, imwanang'ina wake yumwe kamlongela, “Imtwatsa, utulangulitse kulomba ka Yohane pfayawalangulitse iwanang'ina wake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamlomba, mlonge apfi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Aba wetu, <note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="fk">Aba </char> Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghangi gha ghumwande ghongetsa Aba wetu uli kulanga. </note> taghwa lyako lienzeluka litogholighwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Undewa wako utse.<note caller="g" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="fk">Aba, </char> Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghangi gha ghumwande ghongetsa, Ghoubama ghatendeke mne isi ka ako kulanga. </note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Utwing'e ichijo chetu cha chila litsuwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Utuleghusile nzambi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q">ka pfatumleghusila chila yumwe yatutendele ghehile.</para>
  <para style="q">Na uleke kutwingitsa mne kughetsighwa.’ ”<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="fk">Kughetsighwa. </char> Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghangi gha ghumwande ghongetsa. Lekeni utukombole na yula yehile. </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tulonge yumwe wenu kaghenda mne ing'anda ya sale yake nechilo ne ukulonga, ‘Sale yangu, nokulomba ungaye ichijo, <verse number="6" style="v"/>kwaapfila sale yangu yali mne ghumwanza katsa ukaye yangu, na nene nahela ichijo cha kumwing'a!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Na tulonge sale yako yali mng'anda kokwidika, ‘Leka nibwihile! Libani lihindighwa, nene ne iwanangu tuwasa. Sidaha bae kulamka na kukwing'a ichinu chochose!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nowalongela hata ka ng'atsolamka bae na kukwing'a ichijo kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa sale yake, hambele katsolamka na kukwing'a chila ichinu ichaubamile kwaapfila ng'awonile bae chinyala kughendelela kumlomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Apfo nowalongela, mlombe namwe mtsakwing'ighwa, mbame namwe mtsopata, mghong'onde libani namwe mtsofughulighwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyolomba katsobokela, ne imunu wowose iyobama katsopata, ne imunu wowose iyoghonga libani katsofughulighwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aba wachi mna mwemwe iyomwing'a imwanaghe inzoka, ka imwanaghe kamlomba isomba? <note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="fk">Kamlomba isomba. </char> Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghangi gha ghumwande ghongetsa Ang'amlomba chighate, naye katsomwing'a libwe. </note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Au ang'amlomba lifinga, katsomwing'a inge? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ka mwemwe imwihile, mwomanya kuweng'a ipfinu pfinonoghile iwanenu, apfi Aba wenu yali kulanga ng'atsoweng'a bae Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iwanu wala iwomlomba?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:22-30; Maliki 3:20-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ang'ali yomlapfa ichinyamkela chibubu, na ichinyamkela hayalawile, imunu yula kandusa ukulonga, iwanu wakangawala. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wangi walonga, “Ambe Belisebuli, imkulu we ipfinyamkela iyo iyomwing'a yeye ngupfu tsa kuwalapfa ipfinyamkela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wabama kumghetsa Yesu, apfo wamlomba Yesu atende chitango kulangusa ka kana ingupfu kulawa kulanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, apfo kawalongela, “Undewa wowose iwighola wenyegho kwa wenyegho ng'autsakwima bae. Na ing'anda ing'awa na maghomba itsakughwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ka Setani keghola imwenyegho, apfi undewa wake utsakwimatse? Nolonga pfino kwaapfila mwemwe mwolonga nolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa tsingupfu tsa Belisebuli. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ka nene nowalapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tsa Belisebuli, apfi iwanu wenu wowalapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tsa nani? Iwanu wenu wenyegho watsowahigha mwemwe mtotsa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni ka nolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tse Imulungu, lelo undewa we Imulungu uwatsila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Imunu yane ngupfu hayoikalitsa ing'anda yake kwa mghowa, ipfinu pfake ng'apfisolighwa bae. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu yungi yane ngupfu kumbita yeye hatsomghendela na kumuhuma, katsomboka mghowa ghwehuwile na kupfighola ipfinu pfambokile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose ka ng'ali hamwe na nene bae, ayo konibela. Ne imunu wowose yang'onyapfila nene ukukunga, ayo kopwililisa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kwe ichinyamkela mne imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:43-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ichinyamkela hayomlawa imunu, koghenda mne isi isakale kubama hanu ho kubwihila. Ka ng'apatile bae hanu ho kubwihila, kelongela imwenyegho, ‘Nitsakuya keli mne ing'anda yangu yaniilekile.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo kakuya keli na kuipfika ing'anda yake itsengighwa pfinoghile. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kuya koghenda kuwasola ipfinyamkela wangi saba wane ngupfu kubita yeye. Nawo wakutsa kukala mghati mwe imunu ayo. Na ughima we imunu ayo wakuwa wiha kubita aho mwanduso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukudeng'elela kwo ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali yolonga ipfinu pfino, ipinga yumwe kulawa mne kingili kamlongela Yesu, “Kabweda ipinga iyakweleke na iyakwong'etse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Wabweda ghendo iwanu wala iwoitegheletsa Imbuli ye Imulungu na kuikinda.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wobama kwona ichitango</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu hawang'ali wakwongetseka, Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Aghuno mweleko ghwihile, ghwobama ichitango. Ng'amtsakwing'ighwa bae ichitango chochose, ila ichitango chila cha Yona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka Yona pfayawile ichitango kwe iwanu wa Ninawi, pfipfila Imwana we Imunu katsakuwa ichitango kwe iwanu wa mweleko ghuno. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, Malikiya wa Seba katsakwima na kuwahigha iwanu wa mweleko uno, kwaapfila yeye tsakalawa mne isi yake kaghenda kutegheletsa ghamahala gha ihekima ghe Mndewa Selemani, na hano hana mkulu kubita Imndewa Selemani. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, iwanu wa Ninawi watsakwima na kuwahigha iwanu wa mweleko ghuno, kwaapfila wawo tsawatsileka nzambi tsawo hawamhulike Yona. Nowalongela ghendo, imunu mkulu kubita Yona kabaha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ichitasa cha lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 5:15; 6:22-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kuduhu imunu iyotuwa ichitasa na kuchipfisa au kuchighubika kwa chiha. Lekeni kochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa, ili iwanu iwakwingila mghati wadahe kwona ghumwanga. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Tsinenge tsako tsaichitasa cha lukuli lwako. Ka tsinenge tsako tsakona, lukuli lwako lwose lwenela ghumwanga. Lekeni ka ng'atsikona bae, pfipfila lukuli lwako lwose lwenela chisi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Walangitse ghumwanga ighuli mlukuli mwako, ghuleke kuwa ichisi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apfo, ka lukuli lwako lwose lwenela ghumwanga, na kuduhu ichisi, lukuli lwose lutsong'ala ghendo ka ichitasa pfachikumwemwesela kwa ghumwanga ghwake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahigha Mafarisayo na iwalangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 23:1-36; Maliki 12:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga, Mfarisayo yumwe kamlomba Yesu aghende naye ukuja. Apfo Yesu kengila mng'anda, kakala hasi kaja. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mfarisayo ayo kakangawala hayamwonile Yesu kakuja bila kuhopfugha ghamoko ghake. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuya Imtwatsa kamlongela, “Mwemwe Mafarisayo mwohopfugha ichikombe ne isahani kwa kunze, lekeni mghati mwenu mmema ukuboka na ukwiha. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwawabotsi! Apfi ayula iyalumbile kunze, si yuyula bae iyalumbile mghati? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lekeni muweng'e wahingwa ipfinu ipfili mghati mwe ipfikombe na tsisahani tsenu, na chila chinu chitsonogha kuna mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya mwemwe Mafarisayo! Kwaapfila mwomlapfila Imulungu tsaka tse bwasi ne itsimbogha tsose ka mnapfu ne imitsani ingi, lekeni mwoleka kutenda ghanoghile kwe iwanu na mwoleka kumnoghela Imulungu. Mwobamighwa tanu muwe iwanu we haki na iwomnoghela Imulungu, bila kughaleka agho ghangi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya mwemwe Mafarisayo! Kwaapfila mwonoghela kukala mne ipfighoda pfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela, na kulamsighwa kusoko. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mtsoghoya, kwaapfila mweghala ne tsikabuli ing'atsikonekagha bae, na iwanu wobita mchanya akuno ng'awomanya bae”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mlangulitsi yumwe wa Ghamalaghitso kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, pfulonga pfino pfipfila kwotuligha na twetwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Pfipfila mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso mtsoghaya! Kwaapfila mwowatwika iwanu imitsigho mitito ng'ani, nayo ng'aidutika bae. Na mwemwe wenyegho ng'amuikinda bae hata kwa kugholosa chidole chimwe cha pfidole pfenu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mtsoghaya kwaapfila mwowatsengela tsikabuli manabii wala iwakomighwe ne iwabala wenu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mwemwe wenyegho mwotoghola aghala ghawatendile iwabala wenu, tsawawakoma manabii, namwe mwowatsengela tsikabuli tsawo. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Apfo, Hekima ye Imulungu tsailonga, ‘Nitsowatuma manabii ne iwatumighwa, wangi watsokomighwa na wangi watsowingighwa.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Apfo mweleko ghuno ghutsohighighwa kwa kuwakoma manabii wose kulawa isi hailumbighwe, <verse number="51" style="v"/>kulawa kukomighwa kwa Abeli mbaka kukomighwa kwa Sakariya, iyakomighwe mghati mwe hanu he ukulapfila inambiko na hanu henzeluke. Ona, nowalongela lukolo luno lutsohighighwa kwa kuwakoma awo wose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Mtsoghoya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso! Kwaapfila mpfisa ufughulo wa libani lye ing'anda ya kumanyila. Namwe iwenyegho ng'amwingile bae, na mwowakima iwanu wala iwang'ali wakwingila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu hayokile hanu hala, Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wandusa kumghobola kwa kumghutsa ipfinu pfingi, <verse number="54" style="v"/>wabama wamghoghe kwa ichinu chochose chatsolonga.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokembela ung'enye</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:26-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi tsawetingana mbaka wang'ali webajugha, tanu Yesu kandusa kulonga ne iwanang'ina wake, “Mwalangitse ne hamila ya Mafarisayo ya ung'enye. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chochose ichighubikighwe chitsoghubulighwa, na chochose ichifisighwe chitsomanyika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chochose chamlongile mchisi chitsohulikighwa mne ghumwanga, na chochose chamwinong'onetse mng'anda, chitsolongighwa mwatsimwatsi mchiswili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi wa kumpfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:28-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nowalongela sale tsangu, mleke kuwapfuka iwanu wala iwolukoma lukuli, lekeni ng'awodaha bae kutenda ichinu chochose chihile. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nitsowalangusa yuhi wa kumpfuka. Mumpfuke Imulungu, hayomalitsa kukoma kodaha kumwasa imunu jehanamu. Nowalongela, mumpfuke yeye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Apfi pfideghe watano ng'awoghulighwa bae kwa sendi mbili? Lekeni kuduhu yumwe wao yosemwighwa ne Imulungu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hata tsimvili tsili mne mwitwi mwenu tsipetighwa. Mleke kupfuka kwaapfila mwemwe mnogha ng'ani kubita iwapfideghe wengi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola na kumlema Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:32-33; Maliki 10:19-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene hambele he wanu, Imwana we Imunu naye katsomtoghola hambele he malaika we Imulungu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu iyondema nene hambele he iwanu, naye Imwana we Imunu katsomlema hambele he malaika we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose iyomlonga pfihile Imwana we Imunu katsolekelelighwa, lekeni imunu wowose iyomligha Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ng'atsolekelelighwa bae. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hamtsoghalighwa mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela, kwe iwatawala ne kwe iwakulu, mleke kupfuka chokulonga na chakwidika. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu katsowalangulitsa chambamighwa kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya tajiri mbotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe kulawa mne iwanu iwemile hala kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, mlongele ndughu yangu twigholele ipfinu pfatuleke aba wetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Sale yangu, angu yuhi yanyikile nene niwe mlamutsi au niwe mghola pfinu pfenu?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela wose, “Mwalangitse ne ubwa! Kwaapfila ughima we imunu ng'aulawa bae mna pfinu pfingi pfali napfo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino; “Tsahana imunu yumwe tajiri tsa yane na mghunda ghunoghile ghumwelekele pfijo pfingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo kefikitsa mmoyo mwake, ‘Nahela hanu ha kwikila pfijo pfangu. Lelo nitendatse?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kalonga, ‘Nitsotenda apfino; nitsotsimwagha kano tsangu na kutsenga tsingi ng'ulu ng'ani. Amo nitsakwika imitama yangu ne ipfinu pfangu pfingi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya nitselongela mwenyegho; 'Ghwe ghumoyo ghwangu! Kwinapfo ipfinu pfingi kwa miyaka mingi. Bwihila ghwe; uje, unwe na udeng'elele!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela imunu tajiri, ‘Kwambotsi ghweghwe! Chilo chichino ughima wako utsobamighwa! Pfinu pfawikile pfitsakuwa pfa nani?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Apfi pfipfo pfapfitsakuwa kwe imunu wowose yeikile utajiri imwenyegho, lekeni ng'akwika bae utajiri kwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 6:25-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Mleke kughaya na ukwalangula kwe ichijo chambama ili mkale waghima, au ghamaghwanda ghambama kwa ng'uli tsenu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ughima unogha kubita ichijo na lukuli lunogha kubita maghwanda. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mlole iwabondwa; ng'awahanda bae wala, ng'awopfuna bae, wala wahela kano, lekeni Imulungu kowang'itsa! Mwemwe mnogha ng'ani kubita wapfideghe! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfi yuhi mna mwemwe kwa kwidununza kodaha kwongetsa litsuwa limwe mne ughima wake? <note caller="j" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="fk">Kwongetsa litsuwa limwe mne ughima wake. </char> au kwitenda awe mtali. </note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ka ng'amdaha bae kutenda chinu chidodo ka chino, ebali mwopfidununzikila pfinu pfingi? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mlole ghamaluwa pfaghokula; ng'aghosang'ana bae wala ng'aghefoghosa bae. Lekeni nowalongela hata mndewa Selemani na tsimali tsake tsose ng'apfalile bae pfinoghile ka luwa limwe mne ghamaluwa ghano. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ka Imulungu koipfatsa imitsani ya kumghunda leloli lya baha, na ilupfi lyakwasighwa mmoto, apfi ng'atsowatendela mengi bae? Pfii mwemwe yamtoghola chidogho!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mleke ukwalangula mtsakuja choni au mtsakunwa choni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu yang'awammanyile Imulungu wopfihamela ipfinu apfo. Na Aba wenu iyali kulanga komanya ipfinu pfambama. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni muubame undewa wake ne ipfinu pfino mtsakwing'ighwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri wa kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 6:19-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mwemwe wanang'ina wangu, mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila Aba wenu kanoghelwa kuweng'ani undewa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muutse ipfinu pfenu muweng'e tsisendi iwahingwa. Mwitendele imikoba yang'ailalagha bae, na mwike utajiri wenu kulanga, hanu hang'autsohunguka bae. Aho haduhu mbapfi iyodaha kwiba na haduhu mswa iyodaha kuuhinya. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hane utajiri wako, ghumoyo ghwako ghutsakuwa baho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kaleni ghoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Mwohe misipi mne pfuno pfenu, ne ipfitasa pfenu pfiwe pfakwaka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muwe ka watumwa iwombeta imkulu wawo iyakuya kulawa kune ichihungo cha kukwela. Hakuya na kugong'onda libani, baho wompfughulila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wabweda iwatumwa wala imkulu wawo hakuya kowapfika wameso. Nowalongela ghendo, imkulu ayo katseyoha msipi mchuno, katsokala nawo mchijo na kuwasang'anila. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Itsakuwa ghoya kwe iwatumwa wala imtwatsa wawo ka katsowapfika weyandaa, hata ang'oya nechilo ng'ani. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lekeni mmanye apfino; Ka imunu yane ing'anda ang'amanyile lisaa atsakutsa mbapfi, ang'akalile meso. Wala tsang'oileka bae ing'anda yake ibenighwe ne mbapfi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe mwobamighwa mwiyandae, kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa lisaa mwemwe ng'amumbetela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imtumwa iyohulika ne ing'ahulika bae</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:45-51)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Petiri kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, apfi kwotulongela twetwe tuliyeka imbuli ino au kowalongela iwanu wose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kamwidika, “Apfi yuhi imtumwa mwenyepfale na yane ihekima? Imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake yamwikile kuwatawala iwatumwa wangi, na kuweng'a ichijo chawo mne ichipindi chinoghile. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Itsakuwa ghoya kwe imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake hayatsokuya katsompfika kotenda apfo. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imkulu ayo katsomwika imtumwa yula kupfitawala ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lekeni imtumwa yula ang'elongela imwenyegho, ‘Imtwatsa wangu ng'atsakuya sambi bae’ kuya kakwandusa kuwatowa iwatumwa wose iwamale ne iwapinga, naye kakuja na ukunwa mbaka kopatika. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Imtwatsa we imtumwa yula katsakutsa mne litsuwa lila imtumwa ayo ng'olimanya bae na mne saa lila ng'alilolele bae, na mkulu ayo katsomghana imtumwa wake mne pfihindi pfili na kumwika hane iwanu iwalemile kutoghola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Na imtumwa yula iyomanya aghala ghayobama imtwatsa wake aghatende, lekeni ng'okala ghoya bae wala ng'oghatenda bae, imtumwa ayo katsotohighwa ng'ani. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lekeni imtumwa yula ng'amanyile bae ipfinu pfayabamighwe ne imkulu wake apfitende, naye katenda pfihile, imtumwa ayo katsotowighwa chidogho. Imunu wowose iyeng'ighwe pfingi, kuna yeye pfitsobamighwa pfingi. Na kwe imunu wowose iyeng'ighwe pfingi ng'ani pfitsobamighwa pfingi ng'ani kuna yeye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatenda iwanu webaghule</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Nitsa ukwasa ghumoto muisi, na tsanibama ma ghuwe ghutuwitsighwa! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ninawo ubatitso wa maghayo nobamighwa niubokele, na nene noghaya ng'ani mbaka umale! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Apfi mwopfikitsa nitsa kuitenda iisi ikale tseghamba? Bae! Sitsile kuwatenda iwanu wakale tseghamba, ila kuwaghola iwanu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kulawa sambi iwanu watano wali mne kaye imwe watsesonga, wadatu kwa weli na weli kwa wadatu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Tsina tate watsesonga ne iwana wawo, ne iwana watsesonga na aba tsawo. Tsina mai watsesonga ne iwana wawo ne iwana watsesonga na mai tsawo. Mai wakwe watsesonga na wakamwana wawo, na wakamwana watsesonga na wakwe tsawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kutsimanya tsinyakati</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 16:2-3)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanu, “Hamkwona liwingu lyakutsa ubali ukuswela litsuwa, baho mwolonga, imvula itsotowa, na kuya imvula yotowa. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na hamkwona libeho kulawa ubali wa kuhisi, mwolonga, ‘Kutsakuwa na lijoto,’ na yakuwa pfipfo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mwawang'enye! Mwodaha kulola muisi na mlanga na kulonga imvula itsotowa au litsuwa litsakwalika. Pfii ng'amdaha bae kughamanya matsuwa ghano gha sambi?</para>
  <para style="s">Wighongole ne mwihile wako</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 5:25-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Ebali mwemwe iwenyegho ng'amdaha bae kwilamlila chinu chihi ichinoghile? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ka imunu yane lighomba naghwe kokughala mne ing'anda ya kuhighila. Mnzila utende pfaudaha wighongole naye ng'ana wingile mne libalatsa. Ka si pfipfo bae, mlamutsi katsokughala kwa asikali, na asikali watsokwika mchifungo. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nokulongela, ng'autsolawa bae mbaka ulapfe sendi yako ya mwisho!”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mleke tsinzambi hela mtsakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ichipindi chichila tsahana iwanu iwampetele Yesu mbuli tsa Wagalilaya iwakomighwe na Pilato hawang'ali womlapfila Imulungu inambiko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi mwemwe mwopfikitsa Wagalilaya wala tsawana nzambi kubita Wagalilaya wangi kwaapfila tsawadununzika pfino? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bae! Nowalongela ka ng'amtsileka nzambi tsenu, pfipfila namwe mwose mtsakufa ka pfawapfile wao. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya pfii iwanu wala kumi na wanane iwafile kwa chilingilo ichiwaghwile ako Siloamu? Apfi mwopfikitsa iwanu wala wakala na nzambi kubita iwanu wangi iwokala Yerusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bae! Nowalongela ka ng'amtsileka nzambi tsenu, pfipfila namwe wose mtsakufa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mtini ing'aghukweleka ghamatunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe yane mbiki wa matunda mne mghunda wake wa mitsabibu. Kaghenda kubama litunda mne mbiki awo, lekeni ng'apatile bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo kamlongela mkalitsi wa mghunda aghwo, ‘Lola, kwa miyaka midatu tsaning'ali nikutsa hano kubama matunda mne mbiki ghuno, sipatile chinu bae. Ghughane! Ebali ghughendelele kulihinya lidongo?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni mkalitsi wa mghunda kamwidika, ‘Imtwatsa, ghuleke kwa ghumwaka ghuno ghumwe, na nene nitsoghuhimbila na kughwikila imboleya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya ghung'eleka ghamatunda itsakuwa ghoya! Lekeni ka ng'aghutsakweleka, kutsoghughana.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ipinga mna Litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mna Litsuwa lya Sabato Yesu ang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ya ukulombela. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Baho tsahana ipinga yumwe yane ichinyamkela iyamtendile yaghule kwa miyaka kumi na nane. Tsakapfeduka na ng'adahile bae kwigholosa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hamwonile, kamkema, kamlongela, “Mai kuhonetsighwa utamu wako!” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamwikila ghamoko ipinga ayo, bahala kagholoka na kamtunya Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela tsakona maya kwaapfila Yesu kamhonetsa mai ayo mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, apfo kawalongela iwanu, “Mwinagho ghamatsuwa sita gha kusang'ana. Mtse mna ghamatsuwa agho mhonetsighwe, mleke kutsa mne Litsuwa lya Sabato!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kedika, “Mwa wang'enye! Apfi yumwe wenu ng'odaha bae kumdohola ing'ombe au ipunda wake kulawa hanu ha ukujila mne Litsuwa lya Sabato na kumlongotsa aghende kunwa ghamatsi? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ipinga yuno kaimwana wa Abrahamu, iyaghoghighwe na Setani kwa miyaka kumi na nane. Lelo pfii ng'apfinoghile bae kumdohola mne Litsuwa lya Sabato?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu halongile apfi, iwehile wake tsawona chinyala, lekeni iwanu tsawang'ali wodeng'elela kwa ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa ipfitendighwe na Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:31-33; Maliki 4:30-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi Undewa we Imulungu wighala na choni? Apfi nitumile imbuli yachi? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wighala ne imbeghu ndodo ya haladali iyaisolile imunu yumwe na kuihanda kumghunda. Imbeghu ila ikula na kuwa mbiki mkulu, na iwapfideghe watsenga ipfibali mna ghamaputila ghake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa keli, “Apfi nitumile imbuli yachi mmanye Undewa we Imulungu? Wighalile na choni? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wighala ne hamila iyaisolile ipinga yumwe na kaitipfa ne usaghe mwingi na usaghe wose usasuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Libani lisisili</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 7:13-14,21-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghendelela na ghumwanza ghwake kughenda Yerusalemu. Hayang'ali mnzila, kabitila mne imiji ne ipfijiji, kawalangulitsa iwanu ako. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe kamghutsa Yesu, “Mtwatsa, apfi watsokombolighwa iwanu chidodo waliyeka?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mtende pfamdaha kwingila mng'anda kubitila mne libani lisisili, kwaapfila iwanu wengi watsobama kwingila mng'anda lekeni ng'awatsodaha bae. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imunu yane ing'anda katsakwima na kulihinda libani. Namwe mtsakwima kunze na ukwandusa kughong'onda libani na ukulonga, ‘Imtwatsa tupfughulile.’ Lekeni yeye katsowedika, ‘Siwamanyile bae kwamlawa kwani!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kuya mtsomwidika, ‘Twetwe twa awala yatujile na ukunwa naghwe, na tsakutulangulitsa mne isi yetu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni katsolonga keli, ‘Siwamanyile bae kwamlawa kwani. Laweni hano, mwemwe mwose yamtendile ghehile!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mtsolila na kugheghedula ghamatsino hamtsomwona Abrahamu, Isaka, Yakobu ne manabii wose wamne undewa we Imulungu, lekeni mwemwe mwasighwa kunze! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu watsakutsa kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua ne ubali wa kwalikuswela litsuwa, na kulawa ubali wa kuchanya na kuhisi, watsokala mne chihungo wakuja mne undewa we Imulungu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu iwawile wa usighilo watsakuwa wa mwanduso, ne iwanu iwawile wa mwanduso watsakuwa wa usighilo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koyonela libatsi Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 23:37-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Matsuwa ghaghala Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela Yesu, wamlongela, “Ughende hanu hangi kwaapfila Herodi kobama akukome.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mghende mumlongele ayu yumbwa wa kumuhulo, ‘Leloli na ilupfi nolapfa ipfinyamkela na kuwahonetsa iwanu, na mne litsuwa lya kadatu nitsomalitsa isang'ano yangu.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hata apfo, nobamighwa leloli na ilupfi na ikacha nighendelele na ghumwanza ghwangu kwaapfila ng'apfinoghile bae nabii kukomighwa kunze kwa Yerusalemu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Ghwe Yerusalemu! Ghwe Yerusalemu! Kwowakoma manabii na kuwatowa kwa ghamabwe iwatumwa we Imulungu iwatumighwe kuna ghweghwe! Mara nyingi tsambama kuwakunga iwanagho ka ng'uku pfowaghubika pfitsiya wake kwa ghamabawa ghake, lekeni ghweghwe ng'aubamile bae! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mlole, mlekelighwa ing'anda yenu. Nowalongela, ng'amtsombona keli bae mbaka mlonge, ‘Kabalikiighwa ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu imtamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe lya Sabato, Yesu tsakaghenda kuja mne ing'anda ye imkulu wa Mafarisayo. Iwanu wang'ali wamlolesa ng'ani Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imunu yapfimbile lukuli kaghenda hambele ha Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo, “Apfi pfinogha kumhonetsa imunu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato au ng'apfinoghile bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awalongile chinu bae. Apfo Yesu kamkinda imtamu ayo, kamhonetsa, kamleka yoke. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Ka yumwe wenu kana imwana au ing'ombe kaghwila mchisima mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, apfi ng'odaha bae kumkwegha alawe kunze?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awadahile bae kumwidika.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhola na uluso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu halolile iwahenza wangi pfawang'ali wosaghula ipfighoda ipfili hambele, kawalongelela wose imbuli ino, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ka imunu kakulongela utse mne ichihungo cha kukwela, uleke kukala mne ipfighoda pfa hambele. Kwaapfila imunu yungi mkulu kubita ghweghwe kodaha kutsa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>ne imunu iyawakemile wose mtse katsokutsila na kukulongela, ‘Winuke akale yuno.’ Kuya kutsakona ichinyala na kughenda kukala mne ipfighoda ipfili kuchughu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni ghweghwe utende apfi, haupfika mne chihungo, ughende kukala mne ipfighoda ipfili kuchughu, ili mwenyekaye hatsakutsa yakulongele, ‘Sale yangu, winuke, utse ukale mne ipfighoda ipfili hambele.’ Kuya kutsotogholighwa ne iwanu wose iwakalile naghwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mkulu katsotendighwa mdodo, ne imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mdodo katsotendighwa mkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela imunu yula iyamlongele atse, “Ka kwowatendela iwanu ichihungo, uleke kuwakema sale tsako au iwandughu tsako au iwanu matajiri iwali habehi naghwe. Ung'atenda apfi, nawo watsokukema ughende mmakaye mwawo, apfo watsokuliha ka ghweghwe pfauwatendele. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni ka kwotenda ichihungo, uwakeme wahingwa, pfimbete, iwanu waholole, na pfifita, <verse number="14" style="v"/>naghwe kutsobalikiighwa, kwaapfila ng'awatsodaha bae kukuliha. Imulungu katsokuliha mne litsuwa lya kutsilihulighwa iwanu iwanoghile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ichihungo chikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe iyakalile na Yesu haulike apfi, kamlongela Yesu, “Kabweda ghendo imunu yula yatsakuja ichijo che chihungo mne Undewa we Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu yumwe tsayang'ali yotenda chihungo chikulu, kawakema iwahenza wengi watse. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ichihungo hachipfikile, imunu yula kamtuma imtumwa wake kuwalongela iwanu iyawakemile watse, ‘Mtse, kwaapfila sambi chila ichinu chitandighwa.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni wose walema kupfika kwaapfila chila imunu tsakakala ne isang'ano yake. Imunu wa mwanduso kamlongela imtumwa ayo, ‘Nighula mghunda nobama nighende nikaghukaghule, Sikutsa bae.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imunu yungi kalonga, ‘Nighula iwang'ombe kumi, sambi noghenda kuwaghetsa. Sikutsa bae.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pfipfila imunu yungi naye kalonga, ‘Nikwela sambi, apfo sidaha kutsa bae.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Imtumwa yula koya ukaye kamlongela imtwatsa wake mbuli tsose. Hahulike apfo, yane kaye kaghudubuka kamlongela imtumwa wake, ‘Ghenda himahima mne ipfijiji ne kaye uwalongele wahingwa, iwanu iwaholole, pfifita na pfimbete watse.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imtumwa ayo kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa, tsanenda ka pfaulaghitse, lekeni hanu ha kukala iwanu hang'ali habaho.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Apfo imtwatsa kamlongela imtumwa wake, ‘Ghenda mne tsinzila na mne ipfijiji uwalongele iwanu watse, ng'anda yangu imeme. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nowalongela, mne iwanu wose yaniwakemile watse, kuduhu hata yumwe yatsolanza ichijo che ichihungo changu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Kughanzika kwa kuwa imwanang'ina</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:37-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Baho iwanu wengi tawelongotsa na Yesu, naye Yesu kawahundukila kawalongela, <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Ka imunu wowose konitsila na ng'omhila bae aba wake na mai wake, mwehe wake ne iwanaghe, iwandughu tsake na lumbu tsake na ng'ouhila bae ughima ghwake, ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na imunu wowose yang'oduta msalaba ghwake na kuniwinza nene, ayo ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ka yumwe wenu kobama atsenge chilingilo, tanu kokala hasi kopeta sendi tsenatso, kulola kana sendi tsa kumalitsila isang'ano. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka kandusa kutsenga ghumsingi, na ng'odaha bae kughumalitsila, iwanu wose iwolola chatendile watsomseka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuya watsolonga, ‘Imunu yuno kandusa kutsenga lekeni ng'adahile bae kumalitsa isang'ano.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Ka mndewa koghenda ne iwanu miya imwe kwitowa na mndewa yungi yane iwanu elufu ishirini tanu katsokala hasi na ukwalangula ka kodaha kwitowa ne mndewa ayo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ka ng'odaha bae, katsowatuma iwatumwa wake waghende kwa mndewa ayo hang'ali kutali wamlombe waleke kwitowa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pfipfila ka imunu ng'odaha bae kuleka chila chinu chenacho ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imunyu ilihela isang'ano</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 5:13; Maliki 9:50)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Imunyu inogha, lekeni ka ihinyika, apfi utsoitendatse inoghe keli? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ng'ainogha bae kuika mne mghunda wala kuitipfa ne imboleya, itsakwasighwa. Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gho kuhulika, yahulike!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ing'olo yaghile</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 18:12-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe iwasola kodi na wane nzambi wamghendela Yesu kumhulikitsa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lekeni Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wandusa kwilongela, “Imunu yuno kawabokelagha iwanu wane nzambi na kuja nawo!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Imunu wachi mna mwemwe yane iwang'olo miya imwe na ng'olo wake yumwe ang'agha, apfi ng'atsowaleka bae wala tisini na tisa akula koyodimila na kughenda kumbama yula yaghile mbaka amwone? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na hayomwona katsodeng'elela na kumwika mmahegha mwake, <verse number="6" style="v"/>na kumghala ukaye. Kuya katsowakema sale tsake ne iwanu iwali habehi naye na kulonga, ‘Mdeng'e na nene, kwaapfila nimwona ing'olo wangu yaghile.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pfipfila nowalongela kutsakuwa na ndeng'elo ng'ulu kulanga kwe imunu yumwe yane nzambi kutsileka nzambi tsake kubita iwanu wala tisini na tisa iwebona wanogha aku ng'awobama bae kutsileka nzambi tsawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya sendi yaghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Au ka ipinga kana sendi kumi, na sendi imwe yagha. Apfi ng'atsotuwa bae ichitasa, na kusegha ing'anda yake na kuibama chila hanu mbaka ayone? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na hayatsoyona sendi ila, katsowakema sale tsake ne iwanu iwali habehi naye na kuwalongela, ‘Mdeng'e na nene kwaapfila niyona sendi yangu yaghile!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pfipfila nowalongela, malaika we Imulungu watsodeng'elela kwe imunu yumwe yane nzambi kutsileka nzambi tsake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imwana iyaghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe yawile ne iwana weli. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imwana mdodo kamlongela aba wake, ‘Aba, ungolele pfinu pfutsongaya.’ Apfo aba kawagholela ipfinu pfake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa chidogho hambele, imwana mdodo kautsa ipfinu pfake. Kuya koka ukaye yawo, kaghenda isi ya kutali, ako katsipwilisa sendi tsake kwa pfinu pfihile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sendi tsake hatsimalile, inzala ng'ulu ilawila mna isi ila yose, naye kakala kahela ichinu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo kaghenda kulomba isang'ano kwe imunu we isi ila, imunu yula kamlaghitsa aghende mne mghunda ghwake akadime wangubi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tsakasulukila kuja imibangu yawajile iwangubi, lekeni kuduhu imunu yamwing'ile ichijo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tsimbutsi tsake hatsimuyile, keghutsa imwenyegho, ‘Aba wangu kana iwanu wengi we isang'ano iwakuja na kuleka ichijo, na nene nahano noghanzika kwe inzala! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nitsakwinuka na kuya kwa aba wangu na kumlongela, Aba, nimtendela Imulungu nzambi, na pfipfila nikutendela ghweghwe nzambi.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sibamighwa bae kukemighwa imwanagho, unende niwe ka yumwe we iwanu wako we isang'ano.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo kenuka koya kwa aba wake.</para>
  <para style="p">“Lekeni hang'ali kakutali, aba wake kamwona kamwonela libatsi; kamtsumila imwanaghe, kamkumbatila, na kamnonela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Imwana kamlongela aba wake, ‘Aba wangu, nimtendela nzambi Imulungu na ghweghwe pfipfila. Sibamighwa bae kukemighwa mwanagho.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni aba wake kawakema iwatumwa wake kawalongela, ‘Himahima! Mghalileni gholole linoghile mumpfatse. Na ipete mna ichidole chake ne imikwabatsa mmaghulu mwake. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mumghale imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe. Leka tutende ichihungo na tudeng'elele. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imwanangu tsakafa, lekeni sambi kamghima, tsakagha, lekeni sambi koneka.’ Apfo wandusa kudeng'elela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ichihungo haching'ali chighendelela, imwanaghe mbala tsaka kumghunda. Hapfikile habehi ne ing'anda, kahulika tsingoma ne iwanu wobigha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfo kamkema imtumwa yumwe, kamghutsa, ‘Angu hano hana choni?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imtumwa ayo kamwidika, ‘Mdodo wako koya ukaye aba wako kamkomela imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe kwaapfila koya mghima!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Imwana imbala kaghudubuka, kalema kwingila mng'anda. Apfo Aba wake kalawa kunze kamlomba engile mng'anda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lekeni kamwidika aba wake, ‘Lola, nikusang'anila miyaka yose ino na silemile bae aghala ghaundaghitse nitenda. Lekeni ng'ungaile bae hata imwana we imene nideng'elele sale tsangu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni imwanagho ayu kahondola mali tsako na mapinga pfiweghe, na hoile ghweghwe kumkomela imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Aba wake kamwidika, ‘Mwanangu, matsuwa ghose ghweghwe kwa hamwe na nene, ne ipfinu pfose pfaninapfo pfako. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni twobamighwa tudeng'elele na kusekelela, kwaapfila mdodo wako tsakafa, lekeni sambi kamghima; tsakagha, lekeni sambi koneka’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mwimilitsi iyakengele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tsahana imunu yumwe yane mali nyingi, naye tsakana mtunza mali wake. Imunu ayo tsakahulika ka mtunza mali wake kapwililitsa mali tsake hela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Apfo kamkema mng'anda kamghutsa, ‘Angu mbuli tsachi tsanihulike tsikulonga ghweghwe? Nipetele ipfinu pfose pfubokele na pfulapfile, kwaapfila ng'udaha bae kuwa keli mtunza mali wangu.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mtunza mali kelongela mmoyo, ‘Mtwatsa wangu katsoniwinga mne isang'ano. Apfi nitsotendatse? Nahela ingupfu ya kulima, na nakwona chinyala kulomba. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sambi nomanya chinu chachi chanitsotenda ili hanitsowingighwa mne isang'ano yangu, iwanu wanibokele mmakaye mwawo.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Apfo kawakema iwanu wose iwodahighwa na imtwatsa wake. Kamghutsa ayula yalongole kutsa, ‘Apfi, mtwatsa wangu yokudahi sendi ngapi?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kamwidika, ‘Pfiya miya imwe pfa ghamafuta gha tsaituni.’ Mtunza mali ayo kamlongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, kala hasi, wandike pfiya miya tano.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya kamghutsa imunu wa keli, ‘Naghwe, udahighwa choni?’ Kamwidika, ‘Maghuniya elufu imwe gha ngano.’ Mwimilitsi kamlongela, ‘Sola cheti chako wandike maghuniya miya nane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Imtwatsa kamtunya mtunza mali yula yehile kwaapfila katenda ipfinu kwa kukengela. Kwaapfila iwanu iwali mne isi ino wakengela mna kutenda ipfinu pfawo kubita iwanu iwali mne ghumwanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nowalongela, mtsitendele tsimali itsili muisi kwipatila sale tsenu wenyegho, ili hatsitsomala, mbokelighwe nawo mne chibumbulika cha ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyotogholighwa mne ichinu chidodo katsotogholighwa mne ichinu chikulu, ne imunu wowose yang'atogholighwa mne ichinu chidodo pfipfila ng'atsotogholighwa bae mne ichinu ichikulu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya ka ng'amtogholighwe bae kwika tsimali tsili mne isi, apfi yuhi iyatsowatoghola kwika tsimali tsa kweli? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ka ng'amtogholighwe bae mna tsimali tse imunu yungi, yuhi yatsoweng'a mwemwe tsimali tsenu iwenyegho?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kuduhu imtumwa iyodaha kuwasang'anila iwatwa weli. Kwaapfila katsomwihila yumwe na kumnoghela yungi; katsolunga na yumwe na kumbetsa yungi. Ng'amdaha bae kumtumikila Imulungu na sendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsingi tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 11:12-13; 5:31-32; Maliki 10:11-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mafarisayo iwonoghela tsisendi hawahulike apfo, tsawambetsa Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwelangusa kwe iwanu mnogha, lekeni Imulungu koimanya imimoyo yenu. Kwaapfila ichinu ichikwoneka chinogha kwe iwanu, kwe Imulungu chakoneka chiha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na mbuli tsa manabii tsipetighwa mbaka mne ichipindi cha Yohane Mbatitsa. Kulawa ichipindi acho, mbuli tsinoghile tse Undewa we Imulungu tsipetighwa, na chila imunu kakwingila kwe ingupfu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pfibewe kwe ililanga ne isi ukwagha, kubita kuhunguka ichinu chidodo mne Ghamalaghitso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Immale wowose iyomleka mwehe wake na kumkwela ipinga yungi kotenda utsinzi, ne immale iyomkwela ipinga iyalekighwe kotenda utsinzi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri na Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Tsahana imunu yumwe tajiri yang'ali yopfala maghwanda gha tsambalau ighaghulighwe kwa sendi nyingi, chila litsuwa yeye yang'ali yohondola pfijo pfinoghile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hane ha libani lyake likulu, tsakekighwa imunu yumwe mhingwa yakemighwe Lazali yane ipfilonda pfingi, <verse number="21" style="v"/>yabamile kuja ipfijo ipfilaghale kulawa mmetsa mwe tajiri. Na iwambwa wamghendela wamlambita ipfilonda pfake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Hambele, Lazali kafa kuya kasolighwa ne wamalaika mbaka mmambagha mwa Abrahamu. Imunu tajiri pfipfila naye kafa kuya katsikighwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Akula kutsimu, ang'ali yodununzika ng'ani, kalola kuchanya, kamwona Abrahamu kwa kutali hamwe na Lazali iyakalile mmambagha mwake. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfo kamkema kwa ukukemelela, ‘Aba Abrahamu, mbonele libatsi! Umtume Lazali achike ichidole chake mne ghamatsi aluhotse lulimi lwangu, kwaapfila nene namne usungu mkulu mne ghumoto ghuno!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Lekeni Abrahamu kamwidika, ‘Wikumbuke mwanangu, mne ughima wako tsakubokela apfila ipfinoghile na Lazali tsakabokela ipfihile. Lekeni sambi Lazali kabahano kodeng'elela, naghwe kwodununzika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hata apfo, mghati mwetu na mwemwe kwikighwa kolongo kulu, ili imunu iyobama kuloka kulawa kuno kutsa kuna mwemwe aleke kudaha, pfipfila kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuloka kulawa kuna mwemwe kutsa kuna twetwe!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imunu tajiri kalonga, ‘Kuya nokulomba aba wangu, umtume Lazali aghende mne kaye ya aba wangu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>amo mna ndughu tsangu watano. Mlekelele aghende akawalongele waleke kutenda ka pfanitendile, ili waleke kutsa hanu hano ha kudununzika.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Abrahamu kamwidika, ‘Ndughu tsako wenao Musa na manabii, leka wawategheletse wawo.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tajiri kalonga, ‘Bae aba wangu. Lekeni ka imunu yatsilihuke kowaghendela, watsotsileka nzambi.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abrahamu kamlongela, ‘Ka ng'awowategheletsa Musa na manabii, ng'awatsotegheletsa hata ang'atsilihuka imunu.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 18:6-7,21-22; Maliki 9:42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Pfitsolawila ghendo ipfinu ipfimuhonza imunu atende nzambi, lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula yatsotenda pfilawile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ing'awile ng'apfu kwe imunu ayo yohighwe libwe lya kusaghila msingo na yasighwe mne ibahali, kubita kumtenda yumwe we iwadodo wano atende nzambi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwalangitse! Ka ndughu yako kakutendela ghehile, umlonge, ang'atoghola totso lyake, umlekelele. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ang'akutendela ghehile mala saba kwa tsuwa limwe, na ang'akutsila mala saba na kukulongela, ‘Nileka,’ naghwe mlekelele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iwatumighwa wamlongela Imtwatsa, “Utwongetsele ukutoghola.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kalonga, “Ukutoghola kwenu kung'awile kudodo ka imbeghu ya haladali, mng'adahile kughulongela mbiki ghuno ghwa mkuyu; ‘Ng'oka, wikehande mwibahali!’ naghwo ghung'awahulikitse.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ing'onde ye imtumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Tulonge yumwe wenu kana imtumwa iyolima kumghunda au iyodima iwang'olo. Apfi hayakuya kulawa kumghunda, katsomlongela imtumwa ayo, ‘Utse tanu, ukale hasi, uje ichijo?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bae! Katsomlongela, ‘Nyambikile ichijo, na wanduse kunisang'anila mbaka hanitsomalitsa kuja na kunwa, kuya naghwe uje na unwe!’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apfi kutsomlongela mighede imtumwa ayo kwaapfila katenda aghala ghalaghitsighwe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe mng'amalitsa kutenda chila chinu chambamighwe kutenda, mwobamighwa kulonga, ‘Twetwe twa iwatumwa iwali si chinu bae. Tutenda pfatubamighwa kutenda.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwakoma kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali kamnzila koghenda Yerusalemu, kabitila mghati mwa Samariya na Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hang'ali yakwingila mne ichijiji chimwe, tsaketingana ne iwakoma kumi, wema kutali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wakemelela, “Yesu, Imtwatsa, twonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hawonile kawalongela, “Mghende mkelanguse kwa wakulu we inambiko.” Hawang'ali woghenda, tsawahona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumwe mna wawo honile kahona, koya kuchughu, aku komtunya Imulungu kwa kukemelela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Keghwisa hasi hane maghulu gha Yesu kamlongela mighede. Ayo tsakakala Msamariya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Apfi si iwanu kumi bae iwahonile? Lelo awala tisa walikwani? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ng'oneke yungi iyoyile na kumtunya Imulungu ila imhenza ayu aliyeka?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela imunu ayo, “Winuke uke, Ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwa Undewa we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:23-28,37-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mafarisayo hawamghutsile Yesu, Undewa we Imulungu utsakutsa tsuwachi, kawedika, “Undewa we Imulungu ng'aukutsa kwa kwoneka kwa tsinenge bae. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyatsodaha kulonga, ‘Wa hano au wa hala.’ Kwaapfila Undewa we Imulungu wa mghati mwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Ghamatsuwa ghakutsa mtsobama kwona litsuwa limwe lya ghamatsuwa ghe Imwana we Imunu, lekeni ng'amtsolyona bae. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na iwanu watsowalongela, ‘Mlole, kahala!’ Au ‘Mlole kahano!’ Lekeni mwemwe mleke kuwawinza. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka lumwesa pfalulawila kulanga na kumwemwesa ubali umwe mbaka ubali ungi, apfo pfipfo Imwana we Imunu pfatsakuwa mne litsuwa lyake. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lekeni tanu yadununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwanu wa mweleko ghuno. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na ka pfaiwile mne ghamatsuwa gha Nuhu, pfipfila itsakuwa pfipfo mne ghamatsuwa ghe Imwana we Imunu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iwanu tsawaghendelela kuja na kunwa, kukwela na kukwelighwa mbaka Nuhu hengile mne safina. Kuya mafuriko ghatsa na kuwakoma wose. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Itsakuwa pfipfo ka pfailawile mne ghamatsuwa gha Lutu. Iwanu tsawaghendelela kuja na kunwa, kughula na kuutsa, kuhanda tsimbeghu na kutsenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lekeni litsuwa lila Lutu hokile Sodoma, ghumoto na ghamabwe igholakatsa ghalaghala hasi kulawa kulanga na kuwalakatsa wose. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Itsakuwa pfipfo mne litsuwa lila Imwana we Imunu hatsoghubulighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Mna litsuwa alyo, imunu iyali mchiswili aku ipfinu pfake pfa mng'anda, aleke kuhulumka kupfisola, pfipfila iyali kumghunda aleke kuya kuchughu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mkumbuke ighampatile mwehe wa Lutu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake katsowaghisa, na wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake, katsoukombola. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nowalongela, litsuwa alyo nechilo iwanu weli watsowasa hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iwapinga weli watsotwanga hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Iwanu weli watsakuwa kumghunda, yumwe katsosolighwa, na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Baho iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Kwani Mtwatsa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye kawedika, “Hane ghumtsogha, maghengele watsetinganila baho.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye chitsuka na mlamutsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawapetela iwanang'ina wake imbuli kuwalangulitsa ka wobamighwa kulomba matsuwa ghose, waleke kwipfa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Mne ghumji ghumwe tsakukala na mlamutsi, ayo ng'ampfukile bae Imulungu wala ng'awanoghele iwanu bae. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pfipfila tsakukala ne chitsuka yumwe mne ghumji agho iyang'ali yomghendelagha kumlomba bila kwipfa mlamutsi ayo, ‘Utulamle nene na mwihile wangu.’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa matsuwa mengi mlamutsi ayo kalema kumwapfila chitsuka ayo. Lekeni hambele kalonga, ‘Hata ka nene simpfuka bae Imulungu wala siwanoghela iwanu bae, <verse number="5" style="v"/>lekeni kwaapfila chitsuka ayu konitsupfa, nitsomlamulila, hela koghendelela kunitsila na kunenda nyipfe!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya Imtwatsa kaghendelela kulonga, “Muhulikitse pfalongile mlamutsi ayu yehile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pfii lelo Imulungu ng'atsowalamulila bae iwanu wala iyawasaghule, iwomlilila chilo na misi? Apfi katsokawa kuwapfila? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nowalongela katsowapfila hima! Hata apfo Imwana we Imunu hatsakutsa, apfi katsopfika iwanu wotoghola mne iisi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Mfarisayo ne imunu iyosola ikodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino iwanu wala iweghoda na kuwabetsa wangi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Iwanu weli waghenda kune ing'anda ye Imulungu kulomba. Yumwe Mfarisayo na yungi imunu iyosola kodi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayo Mfarisayo kema, kalomba mne ghumoyo ghwake, ‘Mighede, Ghwe Imulungu, kwaapfila nene si ka iwanu wangi bae, iwoboka, iwotenda ghehile, watsinzi, wala si ka ayu msola kodi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nene noleka ukuja ghamatsuwa meli mne ghamatsuwa saba, nolapfa tsaka ye ipfinu pfose pfanipata!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Lekeni ayula msola kodi kema kutali, wala ng'alolile bae kulanga. Lekeni ketowa mmambagha mwake kwa usungu, kalonga, ‘Ghwe Imulungu, umbonele libatsi, nene mtenda ghehile.’ ” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nowalongela, “Ayu msola kodi koka ukaye yake akuno katogholighwa ne Imulungu kubita ayula yungi. Kwaapfila imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mkulu katsotendighwa mdodo, na imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mdodo katsotendighwa mkulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 19:13-15; Maliki 10:13-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwanu tsawamghalila Yesu iwana wadodo awekile ghamoko. Iwanang'ina wake hawonile apfi, wawakembela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawakema iwana wamghendele, kalonga, “Muwaleke iwana wadodo wanitsile, mleke kuwaghoma. Kwaapfila undewa we Imulungu wa iwanu ka wano. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yang'aubokela undewa we Imulungu ka imwana mdodo, ng'atsakwingila bae mne undewa awo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 19:16-30; Maliki 10:17-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na mkulu yumwe wa Chiyahudi kamghutsa Yesu, “Mlangulitsi yunoghile, nitende choni ili nidahe kupata ughima wa matsuwa ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Mbona kwonikema ninogha? Kuduhu yanoghile lekeni Imulungu aliyeka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwoghamanya ghamalaghitso. ‘Uleke utsinzi, uleke kukoma, uleke kulonga ughutsu, wategheletse aba wako na mai wako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kamwidika, “Agho ghose nighakinda kulawa udodo wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu haulike apfo kamlongela, “Kuhungukighwa na ichinu chimwe. Utsa pfose pfawinapfo na sendi uwagholele wahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa na utajiri kulanga. Kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu ayo haulike apfi, kwona usungu ng'ani kwaapfila tsakakala tajiri ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu hamwonile kakona usungu, kalonga, “Pfikomu ng'ani kwa matajiri kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila pfibewe kwa ngamiya kwingila mne litobo lye isindano kubita tajiri kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Awala iwahulike apfo waghutsa, “Lelo yuhi yodaha kukombolighwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Ichinu ing'achidahika kwe iwanu, kwe Imulungu chodahika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya Petiri kalonga, “Lola! Twetwe tupfileka ipfinu pfetu pfose twokuwinza ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyalekile ing'anda yake au mwehe wake au iwandughu tsake au iwamweleke au iwanaghe kwaajili ya undewa we Imulungu, <verse number="30" style="v"/>katsobokela pfingi mna matsuwa agha, na ughima wa matsuwa ghose mne chipindi ichikutsa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwa kadatu ukufa kwake na ukutsilihuka kwake.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 20:17-19; Maliki 10:32-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu tsakawasola awala kumi na weli kawalongela, “Mlole! Twoghenda Yerusalemu, na chila chinu chandikighwe na manabii che Imwana we Imunu chitsolawila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwaapfila katsakwikighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. Nawo watsombetsa, watsomligha, watsombwalulila ghamate, <verse number="33" style="v"/>watsomfapula pfiboko, kuya watsomkoma. Mne litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanang'ina ng'awamanyile bae ichinu acho. Tsawapfisighwa mana ye imbuli ayo, na ng'awatangile ighalongighwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 20:29-34; Maliki 10:46-52)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu hapfikile habehi na Yeriko, imunu yumwe ichifita tsakakala mmbalimbali mwe inzila kolomba. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Haulike iwanu wobita, kaghutsa, “kuna choni?” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wamlongela, “Yesu wa Natsareti kobita.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Naye kakemelela, “Yesu, Mtsukulu wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wanu wala iwalongole wamkembela wamlongela anyamale, lekeni yeye kaghendelela kukemelela, “Mtsukulu wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kema kalaghitsa wamghale imunu ayo hana yeye. Hapfikile habehi, Yesu kamghutsa, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Kwobama nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kedika, “Imtwatsa, nobama mbone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Wone! Kutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bahala ichifita ayo kadaha kona, kamuwinza Yesu, aku komtunya Imulungu. Iwanu wose hawonile apfo, nawo pfipfila wamtunya Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu tsakengila mne ghumji ghwa Yeriko na yang'ali yobita mghati mwa ghumji agho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Na ako kukala ne imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Sakayo, imkulu we iwasola kodi, naye tsakakala tajiri. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tsakabama amwone Yesu yalitse, lekeni ng'adahile bae kwaapfila tsahana iwanu wengi, naye tsakakala mghuyi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo katsuma, kawalongolela iwanu, kadina mchanya mwe mkuyu ili amwone Yesu, kwaapfila katsobitila inzila iila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu hapfikile hanu hala, kalola mchanya, kamlongela Sakayo, “Sakayo, hima uhulumke, kwaapfila leloli nobamighwa nisinde mng'anda mwako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo Sakayo kuhulumka himahima kambokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwanu wose hawonile apfo, wandusa kunung'unika na ukulonga, “Kaghenda kukala kwa ‘imunu yane nzambi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni Sakayo kema, kamlongela Yesu, “Lola Imtwatsa, nene nitsoweng'a wahingwa inusu ye ipfinu pfangu, na ka nimboka imunu wowose ichinu, nitsomuyitsila mala nne.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Leloli ukombotsi upfika mne ing'anda ino, kwaapfila ayu naye kamtsukulu wa Abrahamu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mana Imwana wa Imunu katsa kubama na kukombola iwanu iwaghile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwatumwa kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 25:14-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hawahulike agho, Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela imbuli, kwaapfila tsakakala habehi na Yerusalemu, nawo tsawapfikitsa ka undewa we Imulungu wahabehi kulawila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo kalonga, “Imunu yumwe wa lukolo lwa chindewa tsakaghenda mne isi ya kutali akabokele undewa kuya yoye ukaye. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo kawakema iwanu kumi kulawa mne iwatumwa wake, kaweng'a tsisendi kawalongela, ‘Mtsitendele ng'onde ya kuchuutsa pfinu mbaka hanitsakuya.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wa ghumji ghwake wamuhila, wawatuma iwanu wamghendele wakalonge, ‘Ng'atumbama bae imunu yuno atutawale.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Haubokele undewa, tsakoya kalaghitsa iwatumwa yaweng'ile sendi wakemighwe ili amanye chawapatile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamwanduso katsa, kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa sendi yako yungayile yeleka pfibughulu kumi.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kamlongela, ‘Ghoya, mtumwa yunoghile. Kwaapfila kutogholighwa mna chinu chidodo, kwakuwa mkulu mne imiji kumi!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na wa keli katsa, kalonga, ‘Mndewa, sendi yako tsungayile tseleka pfibughulu pfitano!’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naye kamlongela, ‘Naghwe kutsakuwa mkulu mne imiji mitano.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Kuya mtumwa yungi kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa, sendi yako ino tsaniifidika mne chitambala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mana tsanikupfuka kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa imunu mkali. Kosola ipfinu pfang'upfikile, na kupfuna achila ng'auchihandile bae.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mtwatsa wake kamlongela, ‘Nitsokuhigha kwa achila chulongile, ghwe imtumwa wihile! Tsakumanya nene ne imunu mkali, nosola apfila si pfikile bae na nopfuna apfila sipfihandile bae, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ebali ng'awikile bae sendi yangu kubengi, na hanikuya niibokele kuno yongetseka.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kuya kawalongela iwemile habehi, ‘Mbokeni sendi ayo, mkamwing'e yula yane kumi.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nawo wamlongela, ‘Mtwatsa, ma kenatso kumi!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Naye kawedika, ‘Nowalongela chila yane chinu katsakongetsighwa, lekeni ayula yalihela chinu, hata chila chenacho katsobokighwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Sambi awala iwehile wangu iwolema nene ndeke kuwa mndewa wawo, waghaleni hano na muwakome aku nene nolola.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa kudeng'elelighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:1-11; Maliki 11:1-11; Yohane 12:12-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hamalitse kulonga apfo, kawalongolela kaghenda Yerusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hapfikile habehi na Betifage na Betaniya, kune chidunda ichikemighwa Mitseituni, kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Mghende mne tsikaye tsila tsamtsilola. Hamkwingila mna tsikaye atso, mtsomwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa, ng'ana yadinighwe ne imunu bae. Mumdohole mumghale hano.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Imwana we ipunda</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'awaghutsa, ‘Ebali mwumdohola?’ Mumlongele, ‘Mtwatsa kombama.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Na awala iwatumighwe waghenda wapfika ka Yesu pfawalongele. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hawang'ali womdohola imwana we ipunda, iwenyegho wawaghutsa, “Ebali mwomdohola imwana we ipunda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nawo wedika, “Mtwatsa kombama.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya wamghala kwa Yesu, watandika maghwanda ghao mmughongo mwa imwana we ipunda wamdinitsa Yesu mchanya mwake. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na hang'ali yoghenda, iwanu watandika maghwanda ghawo mnzila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hapfikile habehi na mhulumko ghwa chidunda cha Mitseituni, mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanang'ina wake wandusa kudeng'elela na kumtunya Imulungu kwa kukemelela, kwa aghala makulu ghawonile. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Walonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kebweda Imndewa iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa!</para>
  <para style="q">Kulanga kukale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q">ne utunitso kuchanya kulanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wamwenga iwakalile mna mtingano ghula wamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, uwalonge iwanang'ina wako wenyamale!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela, hawano wang'enyamala, ghamabwe ghano ghatsolapfa litsi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolililila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hapfikile habehi na Yerusalemu na kughwona ghumji, kaghulilila, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kalonga, “Ung'amanyile leloli ipfinu ipfighala tseghamba! Lekeni sambi pfifisighwa mnenge mwako. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghatsokutsila, iwehile wako hawatsotsenga maboma, watsokupfingilila na kukubanyabanya chila ubali. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Watsokuhonda ghweghwe ne iwanagho mghati mwa mibanda yako. Ng'awatsokulekela libwe limwe mchanya mwe libwe, kwaapfila ng'umanyile bae ichipindi cha ukutsa kwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kune ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:12-17; Maliki 11:15-19; Yohane 2:13-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kengila kune ing'anda ye Imulungu, kandusa kuwawinga kunze iwanu iwang'ali woutsa ipfinu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa, ‘Ing'anda yangu itsakuwa ng'anda ya ukulombela.’ Lekeni mwemwe muitenda iwe mango ya wabapfi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Chila litsuwa Yesu tsakalangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Iwakulu we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwakulu we iwanu tsawabama wamkome, <verse number="48" style="v"/>lekeni ng'awapatile bae nzila ya kumkomela, kwaapfila iwanu wose wang'ali womuhulikitsa.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu Woghutsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:23-27; Maliki 11:27-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na kuwapetela imbuli inoghile. Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala wamtsila <verse number="2" style="v"/>wamghutsa, “Utulongele, kwe ukulu wachi kwotenda ipfinu pfino? Kuya yuhi yakwing'ile ukulu uno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Na nene nitsowaghutsa imbuli imwe; nilongeleni, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ubatitso wa Yohane ulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni wawo welongetsa iwenyegho, na walonga, “Tung'alonga ulawa kulanga, katsotughutsa, ‘Ebali ng'amumtoghole bae Yohane?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na tung'alonga ulawa kwe iwanu, iwanu wose watsotutowa kwa ghamabwe, kwaapfila wose wamtoghola Yohane kughwa kakala nabii.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo wedika, “Ng'atumanyile bae ulawile kwani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Na nene siwalongela bae kwe ukulu wachi notenda ipfinu pfino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mghunda wa mitsabibu ne iwakulima</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:33-46; Maliki 12:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela iwanu imbuli ino. “Imunu yumwe tsakahanda sabibu mne mghunda wake. Keka iwakulima, kuya koka kukala mne isi ingi kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Msimu wa kuhuna haghupfikile, kamtuma imtumwa kwe iwakulima ili wamgholele ghamatunda gha mitsabibu. Lekeni iwakulima wala wamtowa na wamuwinga ghamoko ghaliyeka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kamtuma imtumwa yungi. Ayo naye wamtowa na wamtendela pfinu pfa chinyala na kumuyitsa ghamoko ghaliyeka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamtuma na wa kadatu. Ayu naye wamlagha na kumuwinga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya, yula yane mghunda kalonga, ‘Nitende choni? Nitsomtuma imwanangu iyanimnoghele. Ayu watsompfuka ghendo.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni awala iwakulima hawamwonile, welongetsa iwenyegho, ‘Hayuno iyo muhala mghunda, leka tumkome na uhala wake uwe wetu!’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo wamlapfa kunze mwa mghunda wa mitsabibu, wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi imunu yane mghunda katsowatenda choni iwakulima wala? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Katsakutsa kuwakoma iwakulima awo, na kuweng'a iwanu wangi mghunda awo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanu hawahulike imbuliyo walonga, “Mbe! Agho ghaleke kulawila!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawatsodolela tsinenge, kalonga, “Kuya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghano choni?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe iwalilemile iwotsenga,</para>
  <para style="q">Alyo liwa libwe kulu lya haghatighati?’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyokughwa mna libwe awo katsobeneka-beneka, ne imunu wowose litsomghwila litsomhonda ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukuliha kodi kwa Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:15-22; Maliki 12:13-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne Watambika wakulu tsawabama wamghoghe Yesu bahala, kwaapfila wamanya ka imbuli ila walongighwa wawo. Lekeni tsawawapfuka iwanu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo wakala wobama ichipindi chinoghile. Wawatuma iwanu iwetendile wanogha, wamghoghe Yesu kwa kumghutsa mbuli, ili wadahe kumghala kwe imkulu we undewa wa Roma. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwanu awo wamghutsa, “Imlangulitsi, twomanya ghweghwe kwolonga na kwolangulitsa ipfinu pfinoghile, ng'aulola bae ukulu we imunu, lekeni kwolangulitsa inzila ye Imulungu kwe ukweli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apfi pfinogha kumwing'a kodi Kaisari au ng'apfinoghile bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamanya ukwiha kwawo, kawalongela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nilanguseni isendi. Ina uhanga wa nani na taghwa lya nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Wa imndewa Kaisari.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Ipfinu pfa Kaisari mmwing'e Kaisari, ne ipfinu pfe Imulungu mwing'eni Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ng'awadahile bae kumghogha kwe achila chialongile hambele he iwanu. Na wakangawala pfaawedike, wanyamala.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya kutsilihuka kwe iwafile</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:23-33; Maliki 12:18-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Masadukayo iwalongagha kuduhu kutsilihuka. Wamwenga wamtsila Yesu na kumghutsa, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Imlangulitsi, Musa tsakatwandikila. ‘Imunu ang'afiwa na ndughu yake yane mwehe, lekeni kahela imwana, imunu ayo yamkwele ipinga ayo, ili yamwelekele ndughu yake iwana.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tsakukala ne iwandughu saba. Wa mwanduso kakwela mwehe, naye kafa ng'alekile iwana bae. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na wa keli kamsola ipingayo, naye kafa ng'alekile iwana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya wa kadatu kamkwela, na pfipfila wose saba, wafa ng'awalekile iwana bae. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mwiso ipinga yula naye kafa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lelo mne litsuwa lya kutsilihuka kakuwa mwehe wa yuhi? Kwaapfila tsakakwelighwa na wose saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Iwanu wa ghamatsuwa ghano wokwela na kukwelighwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>lekeni awala iwasaghulighwe watsilihuke kulawa mne lifwa na wawe ne ugima, ng'awatsokwela bae wala kukwelighwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ng'awatsakufa keli bae, kwaapfila watsokuwa ka wamalaika. Nawo wa iwana we Imulungu kwaapfila watsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lekeni, kulonga iwanu iwafile watsotsilihuka, hata Musa tsakalangusa apfo mne imbuli ya chibagho ichikwaka, baho hayalongile Imtwatsa ka Imulungu we Abrahamu, ne Imulungu we Isaka ne Imulungu wa Yakobu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Naye si Imulungu wa iwanu iwafile bae, lekeni yeye ka Imulungu wa wene ughima. Kwaapfila wose wokala waghima kuna yeye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wangi we iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso walonga, “Imlangulitsi kulonga ghoya!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nawo ng'awadahile bae kumghutsa keli imbuli.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:41-46; Maliki 12:35-37)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Angu pfii iwanu wolonga Kiristu ka Imwana we Daudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Daudi imwenyegho kolonga mne ichitabu cha Tsaburi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Imtwatsa tsakamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukale mne ubali wangu wa kujilo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mbaka niwatende iwanebe wako</para>
  <para style="q">wawe hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako. ka chighoda cha kwikila maghulu’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Daudi kamkema ‘Imtwatsa,’ Pfii lelo yadahe kuwa imwanaghe?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 23:1-36; Maliki 12:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ne iwanu wose hawakalile wamtegheletsa, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Mkale meso ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, iwonoghelwa ukwanga kuno wapfala ghamaghwanda matali na kulamutsighwa mmasoko, na kukala mne ipfighoda pfili ambele mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela na mne ipfihungo. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iwebagha mna tsing'anda tse pfitsuka na kwe ung'enye wolomba kwe ichipindi chitali. Awano watsohighighwa ng'ani.”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nosa ye chitsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:41-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kenula meso, kawona wane tsimali pfowoghela sadaka tsawo mne chinu cha kwikila sadaka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pfipfila kamwona chitsuka yumwe mhingwa koghela sendi mbili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, chitsuka ayu kalapfa kubita wose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila wose walapfa sadaka itsisidile mna tsimali tsawo, lekeni chitsuka ayu mne uhingwa wake kalapfa pfose pfakalile napfo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga pfaitsohinyighwa ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:1-2; Maliki 13:1-2)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ne iwanang'ina wangi wakala wolonga imbuli ye ing'anda ye Imulungu, pfaitsengighwe kwa ghamabwe ghanoghile na nosa itsilapfighwe ne iwanu kumwing'a Imulungu. Lekeni Yesu kalonga, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Agha ghose ghamkona, ghamatsuwa ghatsakutsa, ghatsobomolighwa libwe mchanya mwe libwe lingi, chila limwe litsakwatsighwa hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:3-14; Maliki 13:3-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwanu wamghutsa Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, ipfinu apfo pfitsolawila tsuwachi? Ne ichitango chitsokughwa choni ichipindi ipfinu apfo pfa habehi kutsa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kedika, “Mwalangitse, mleke kughutsukighwa. Kwaapfila wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu, wolonga, ‘Nene iyo imwenyegho,’ ne, ‘Ichipindi cha habehi.’ Mwemwe mleke kuwawinza. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na mng'ahulika imbuli ye ing'ondo na kughaya, mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila ipfinu apfo pfobamighwa tanu pfilawile, lekeni umwisho ng'aukukutsa hima bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Iwanu wa isi ino wetsotowa ne iwanu wa isi ila, ne undewa utsotowa ne undewa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kutsolawila imidedemo mikulu ye isi, ne inzala ne utamu chila hanu. Na kutsolawila ipfinu pfa kupfukighwa, ne ipfitango pfikulu kulawa kulanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni agho ghose ng'ana ghalawile, watsowaghogha na kuwadununza. Watsowaghala mna tsing'anda tse ukulombela, na mne pfifungo, na watsowaghala kwe wandewa na kwe iwatawala kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kubitila agho mtsowapetela Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni mne imimoyo yenu, mleke ukwalangula pfamtsowedika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nene nitsoweng'a imbuli ye ukulonga na nzewele. Kuduhu iwanebe wenu watsodaha kuilema wala kwisonga agho ghamlongile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Namwe mtsohundukighwa hata na welesi wenu, iwandughu tsenu ne iwanu wa habehi namwe na sale tsenu. Nawo watsowakoma wangi wenu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwanu wose watsowahila kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'aitsokwagha hata imvili imwe ya ghamatwi ghenu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwa kududumila kwenu mtsobokela ughima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Hamtsolyona ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu litsungulukighwa ne asikali, baho mmanye kughwa ukuhinyighwa kwake kwa habehi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Baho wali mne isi ye Yudeya watsumile kupfidunda, ne iwali mghati mwe ghumji watsumile kunze, na wose iwali mne imighunda waleke kwingila mna ghumji. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hagho ghatsokughwa ghamatsuwa gha kuhighighwa ili ghose ighandikighwe ghalawile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Watsoghaya ng'ani iwapinga wane inda ne iwoghwaghwisa mne ghamatsuwa hagho! Kwaapfila kutsokughwa na kughaya ng'ani mne isi, ne Imulungu katsowahigha iwanu we isi ino. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Watsokomighwa kwa limaghe, na watsosolighwa mateka ne isi tsose. ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghutsobajughighwa ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae, mbaka ichipindi che iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae hachitsotimila.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kwa Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:29-31; Maliki 13:24-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kuya kutsokughwa ne ipfitango mne litsua, mne ghumwetsi na mne tsinondo. Mne isi kutsokughwa na kughaya kwaajili ya kupfuka litsi lye ibahali na ghamawimbi ghake. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iwanu watsotsilika kwa kupfuka, kwa kubetetsa ighakutsa mne isi yose, kwaapfila ipfinu pfa kulanga pfitsohighisika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Baho watsomwone Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mne libingu ne ingupfu ne utunitso mkulu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na baho ipfinu apfo hapfitsokwandusa kulawila, msangalale. Mwinule ghamatwi ghenu kwaapfila ukombotsi wenu wahabehi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:32-35; Maliki 13:28-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli. “Loleni ghumtini ne imibiki yose. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hamkwona imitsani yake yochipula, mwomanya kughwa chiangatsi chahabehi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Namwe pfipfila hamkwona ipfinu apfo pfolawila, mmanye undewa we Imulungu wahabehi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko uno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka ipfinu apfo pfilawile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lilanga ne isi tsitsoluta, lekeni mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta mbe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkale meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mwalangitse! Imimoyo yenu ileke kughoghighwa ne kuja ng'ani, kupatika na kughaya kwaajili ye ughima uno, na litsuwa lila liwatsile kwa kuwadukitsa ka ghumtegho pfaughogha. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwaapfila litsowatsila iwanu wose iwokala mne uhanga we isi yose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apfo mkale meso ghamatsuwa ghose, mlombe mdahe ukukomboka mne hagho ghose ghatsolawila, na kwima hambele he Imwana we Imunu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Chila litsuwa Yesu kakala kolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu na nechilo koghenda kune chidunda cha Mitseituni na kukala ako. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ne iwanu wose wakala wolamka nemitondotondo na kughenda mne ing'anda ye Imulungu kumtegheletsa.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:1-5; Maliki 14:1-2; Yohane 11:45-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ichihungo cha pfighate pfilihela hamila, ichikemighwe Ichihungo che Ipasaka chikala chahabehi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Na ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wang'ali wobama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lekeni wang'ali wowapfuka iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Setani kamwingila Yuda yakemighwe Isikarioti, yumwe wa wala iwanang'ina kumi na weli. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naye kaghenda kwa ipfilongotsi we inambiko ne iwakulu wa iwanu iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu, kalonga nawo pfatsodaha kumhunduka Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nawo wadeng'elela na watoghola kumwing'a sendi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda katoghola na kandusa kubama uleghelo wa ukumhunduka Yesu ichipindi kuduhu kingili lye iwanu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keyandaa ukuja ichijo che Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:17-25; Maliki 14:12-21; Yohane 13:21-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Litsuwa tsalipfika lye Ichihungo cha Pfighate ipfilihela hamila. Pfipfila likala litsuwa lya kukomighwa kwe iwang'olo we Ichihungo che Ipasaka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kawatuma Petiri na Yohane, kawalongela, “Mghende mkatutengele ichijo ili tuje Ipasaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nawo wamghutsa, “Kobama tukakutengele kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Baho hamkwingila mne ghumji, mtsetingana ne immale yaghalile libigha lya ghamatsi. Mmuwinze mbaka mne ing'anda yatsakwingila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na mtsomlongela yane ing'anda, ‘Imlangulitsi koghutsa, chilikwani chiheleto che iwahenza, ndiye Ipasaka hamwe ne iwanang'ina wangu?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Naye katsowalangusa chiheleto chikulu cha uchanya, ichikwighwe ghoya. Namwe mtenge ichijo amo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Waghenda wachipfika chila ichinu ka Yesu pfawalongele, nawo watenga ichijo cha Ipasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo che Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:26-30; Maliki 14:22-26; 1 Wakolinto 11:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Isaa haipfikile, Yesu kawasola iwatumighwa wake kakala nawo mchijo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Nosulukila kuja ichijo chino che Ipasaka na mwemwe ng'ana nidununzike! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, sitsakuja keli bae mbaka Pasaka haitsolawila mne Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kasola ichikombe che dipfai, kalonga, “Mighede ghwe Imulungu.” Kuya kawalongela, “Mchisole mwose mchisole. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nowalongela kulawa sambi sitsoinwa bae idipfai ino mbaka Undewa we Imulungu utse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya kasola chighate, kalonga, “Mighede Imulungu.” Kachibena, kaweng'a, kalonga, “Aluno lukuli lwangu lwamwing'ighwe mwemwe. Mtende pfino kwa kung'umbuka nene.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pfipfila, hawamalitse kuja ichijo cha nemihe, kaweng'a ichikombe kalonga, “Achi ichikombe cha lilaghano lya sambi lye Imulungu ilili mne idamu yangu, iimwitikilani mwemwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni ghumoko ghwa ayula yatsonihunduka ghwa hamwe na nene mmetsa! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imwana we Imunu katsakufa ka pfailamlighwe, lekeni katsoghaya ng'ani imunu yula iyomhunduka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wandusa kwighutsa iwenyegho, yuhi mna wawo yatsotenda ichinu acho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pfipfila wandusa kwihisanya yuhi mna wawo yatsakuwa mkulu kubita wose. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Iwandewa wa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wowatawala iwanu kwe ingupfu, na wala wane ukulu mna wawo wokemighwa ‘Sale tse iwanu.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lekeni kuna mwemwe si pfipfo bae. Yali mkulu na yawe ka mdodo kubita wose, na chilongotsi yawe ka imunu iyotumikila. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yuhi yali mkulu? Yula iyokala mmetsa, au yula iyakwika ichijo? Ambe yula iyokala mmetsa? Lekeni nene namghati mwenu ka imunu iyosang'ana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Namwe mkala na nene mne ukughetsighwa kwangu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na nene nomwing'ani undewa, ka apfila aba wangu pfangahile nene. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mdahe ukuja ne ukunwa mmetsa mwangu mne undewa wangu, na kukala mne ipfighoda pfa undewa na kughahigha ghamakabila kumi na meli gha Isiraeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga Petiri pfatsombela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:31-35; Maliki 14:27-31; Yohane 13:36-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Simoni, Simoni, ukale meso! Setani tsakabama kuwabeta mwemwe ka uhunga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni nikulombela ghweghwe Simoni, ukutoghola kwako kuleke kuhunguka, naghwe hautsombuyila keli uwapfile iwandughu tsako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela, “Imtwatsa, nene nitoghola kughenda na ghweghwe mchifungo na hata ukukomighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela Petiri, leloli jogholo ng'ana yeke ghweghwe kutsonibela mala ndatu, ka ng'unimanyile bae!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwiyandae kwa ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Pfii hala haniwatumile aku mwahela ghumfuko au mkoba au pfilatu, tsamuhungukighwa na chinu?” Walonga, “Bae! Ng'atuhungukighwe na chinu bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Lekeni sambi yane ghumfuko aghusole, na yane mkoba pfipfila aghusole. Naye yalihela lipanga autse lighwanda lyake ne aghule limwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka aghala igholonga. ‘Naye katsopetighwa ne iwanu wehile’ ghotimila. Nowalongela, hagho ghose ighandikighwe kwaajili ya nene ghobamighwa ghatimile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina walonga, “Mtwatsa, lola, hano hana mimaghe mili.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kawalongela, “Ona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba mne lughongo lwe Mitseituni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kaghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni ka pfatsowele, na wanang'ina wake wamuwinza. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hawapfikile ako, kawalongela, “Mlombe mleke kwingila mne ukughetsighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuya kawaleka, kaghenda utali wa imunu kudaha ukwasa libwe. Katowa ghamaghoti, kalomba, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Ghwe Aba, ung'abama uchilapfe ichikombe chino kuna nene. Lekeni si ka pfanibama nene bae, lekeni ka pfubama ghweghwe.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Baho malaika kamlawila, kamwing'a ingupfu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Naye kwaapfila pfakalile mne usungu, tsakalomba ng'ani. Lijasho lyake tsalikala ka ghamadondwe gha idamu gholaghala hasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hamalitse kulomba, kawaghendela iwanang'ina wake. Kawapfika wawasa, kwaapfila tsawana usungu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Pfii mbona muwasa? Mlamke mlombe, mleke kwingila mne ukughetsighwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:47-56; Maliki 14:43-50; Yohane 18:3-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu hang'ali yolonga, kingili lye iwanu litsa aku lyongotsighwa na Yuda, yakalile yumwe mna iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli. Kamghendela Yesu, kamnonela. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamghutsa, “Yuda, kwomhunduka Imwana we Imunu kwa kumnonela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Na wala iwakalile habehi naye hawonile ighatsolawila, walonga, “Mtwatsa, tuwateme na ghamapanga?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Na yumwe mna wawo kamtowa imtumwa we Mtambika mkulu, kamsepula ghutwi lyake lya kujilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kalonga, “Mleke kutenda keli!” Kamkinda ghutwi lyake, kamhonetsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwakulu we iwanu, iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu, ne iwabala iwamtsile yeye, “Pfii mtsa na ghamapanga ne ipfilungu ka nene na mbapfi? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghose tsanikala na mwemwe mne ing'anda ye Imulungu ng'amnighoghile bae. Lekeni aino iyo isaa yenu, na utawala wa chisi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:57-58,69-75; Maliki 14:53-54,66-72; Yohane 18:12-18,25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kuya wamghogha Yesu, waghenda naye mne ing'anda ye Imtambika mkulu. Petiri kamuwinza kwa kutali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na hawabwinile ghumoto haghati he chibwalu cha libaratsa, wakala hamwe. Petiri naye kakala nawo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Na imtumwa yumwe ipinga kamwona Petiri kakala mne ghumwanga. Kamlola ghoya, kalonga, “Imunu yuno naye tsakakala na Yesu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lekeni Petiri kabela, kalonga, “Ghwe ipinga ghwe, nene simmanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Hambele chidogho, imunu yungi kamwona Petiri, naye kalonga, “Ghweghwe naghwe kwa yumwe wawo.” Lekeni Petiri kalonga, “Aka, si nene bae!” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kuya ibita isaa imwe, imunu yungi kalonga, “Ayu tsakakala naye ghendo, kwaapfila naye Mgalilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Petiri kalonga, “Ghwe imunu ghwe, chulonga sichimanyile bae!” Baho hang'ali yolonga, jogholo keka. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kahunduka, kamlola Petiri. Naye Petiri kakumbuka imbuli iyamlongele Imtwatsa, “Leloli jogholo ng'ana yeke ghweghwe kutsonibela mala ndatu, ka ng'unimanyile bae!” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Petiri kalawa kunze, kalila kwa usungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobetsighwa na kutowighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:67-68; Maliki 14:65)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Iwanu iwang'ali womkalitsa Yesu wandusa kumbetsa na kumtowa. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Wamtowa aku wamghubika tsinenge, wamghutsa, “Utange! Yuhi yakutowile?” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Kuya walonga mbuli nyingi tsa ukumligha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa hane libalatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:59-66; Maliki 14:55-64; Yohane 18:19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Nemitondo haipfikile, iwabala, ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso tsawetingana hamwe, wamghala Yesu kune libalatsa lyawo. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Walonga, “Tulongele ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Ning'awalongela, mwemwe ng'amtsotoghola bae, <verse number="68" style="v"/>na ning'awaghutsa, ng'amtsakwidika. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Lekeni kulawa sambi na kughendelela, Imwana we Imunu katsokala ubali wa kujilo we Imulungu yane Ingupfu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Kuya wose wamghutsa, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu?” Naye kawedika, “Mwemwe mwolonga nene iyo yuyo.” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Walonga, “Lelo twobama ukalangama ungi? Twetwe tuwenyegho tuhulika chalongile!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu hane libalatsa lya Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:1-2,11-14; Maliki 15:1-5; Yohane 18:28-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya wose wenuka wamghala Yesu kwa Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wandusa kumlapfila maghomba, walonga, “Tumwona imunu yuno kowaghisa iwanu wetu. Kawaghoma kuliha kodi kwa mndewa wa Roma, kuya kolonga yeye iyo Kiristu, imndewa.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilato kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe kwa mndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, ka ghweghwe pfulonga.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya Pilato kawalongela Wakulu we Inambiko na mtingano we iwanu, “Sonile bae totso lye imunu yuno.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni wawo wakomangitsa ghendo, “Kwa ghamalangulitso ghake kowasongetsa iwanu iwali Yudeya yose wehisanye na undewa wa Roma. Kandusila Galilaya mbaka akuno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilato hahulike agho, kaghutsa ka Yesu imunu wa Galilaya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hamanyile ka Yesu kolawila isi iyoitawala Herodi, kamghala kwa Herodi, iyakalile Yerusalemu ghamatsuwa agho. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Herodi hamwonile Yesu, kadeng'elela ng'ani kwaapfila kwa ghamatsuwa mengi tsaang'ali yobama amwone. Kwaapfila tsakahulika mbuli tsake, na ang'ali yomlolela Yesu yatende pfinu pfa kukangawatsa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apfo Herodi kamghutsa mbuli nyingi, lekeni Yesu ng'amwidike bae. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wakulu we inambiko na Walangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso tsawema hala, wamlapfila Yesu maghomba kwe ingupfu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Herodi ne asikali wake wamtendela Yesu pfihile na wambetsa. Kuya wampfatsa lighwanda linoghile wamuyitsa kwa Pilato. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kulawa baho Herodi tsakawa sale wa Pilato. Kwaapfila ghumwande tsawang'ali wehila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:15-26; Maliki 15:6-15; Yohane 18:39-19:16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato kawakema hamwe Iwakulu we Inambiko, iwabala, ne iwanu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kuya kawalongela, “Mumghala imunu yuno kuna nene ka imunu iyowaghitsa iwanu wehisanye na undewa wa Roma. Nene nilamla mbuli tsake akuno mwemwe mwolola, lekeni sonile bae chochose chihile mne maghomba ghamlongile kuna yeye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Naye Herodi pfipfila katuyitsila twetwe munu yuno, kwaapfila ng'onile bae totso lyake. Apfo, imunu ayu ng'atendile chochose bae ichimtenda akomighwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo nitsomtowa kuya nitsomlekelela.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Herodi tsakabamighwa amlekelele mwohighwa yumwe mne chihungo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wakemelela lumwe, “Umkome imunu ayu! Utulekelele Baraba!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Baraba tsakakala imunu yekighwe mchifungo kwa kutenda hengele na ukukoma mne ghumji. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilato tsakabama kumlekelela Yesu, apfo kalonga nawo keli. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni wakemelela, “Muwambe mna msalaba! Muwambe mna msalaba!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kawalongela lwakadatu, “Ebali? Atendile choni chihile? Sonile bae totso lyolyose lihile ilimtenda yakomighwe. Apfo nitsompfapula, kuya nomlekelela.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni wakemelela ng'ani, wabama Yesu yawambighwe mna msalaba. Na kwa kukemelela kwawo wamtenda Pilato atoghole. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfo Pilato kalamla chawabamile chitendeke. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kamlekelela ayula yawambamile, ayula yekighwe mchifungo kwa hengele na ukukoma, kamlapfa Yesu yakomighwe ka pfawabamile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambighwa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:32-44; Maliki 15:21-32; Yohane 19:17-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hawang'ali womghala, watingana ne imunu yumwe yakemighwe Simoni, imunu wa Kirene, iyang'ali iyolawa kumghunda. Wamghogha wamtwika msalaba yaughale kuchughu kwa Yesu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wamuwinza, hamwe ne iwapinga iwang'ali womlilila na ukunyanyana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawahundukila kawalongela, “Iwapinga wa Yerusalemu, mleke kundilila nene, ila mwililile iwenyegho na iwanenu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghakutsa hawatsolonga, ‘Wabweda iwapinga iwalihela iwana, ing'aweleke iwana na yang'awakong'ese bae.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuya watsopfilongela pfidunda, ‘Tughwileni!’ na pfidunda, ‘Tughubikeni!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka iwanu wotenda pfinu pfino kwa mbiki mbisi, itsokuwatse kwa mbiki iusakale?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi iwabapfi pfipfila waghalighwa wakomighwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hawapfikile hanu hakemighwe “Bombwe lya Litwi,” baho wamuwamba Yesu na awala iwanu wehile mne misalaba, yumwe ubali wake wa kujilo na yungi ubali wake wa kumoso. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Aba, wonele libatsi kwaapfila ng'awamanyile bae chawotenda.” Nawo wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa kutowa simbi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iwanu tsawema baho wolola, iwakulu wa Wayahudi hawang'ali wombetsa. Walonga, “Tsakawakombola iwanu wangi, leka yekombole imwenyegho, ka yeye Kiristu, Imkombotsi iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asikali pfipfila wambetsa. Wamghendela wamwing'a isiki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>wamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa imndewa wa Wayahudi, wikombole umwenyegho!” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mchanya mwa msalaba wake tsakukala ne ichitango chino. “Ayuno iyo Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mbapfi yumwe mna awala iwabapfi iwawambighwe kamligha Yesu, kalonga, “Pfii ghweghwe si Kiristu bae? Wikombole imwenyegho kuya utukombole na twetwe!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lekeni ayula mbapfi yungi kamkembela miyaghe kalonga, “Ghweghwe! Ng'umpfuka Imulungu bae, naghwe kuhighighwa ka yeye? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nene na ghweghwe tuhighighwa kwa haki, apfo twobokela maliho gha aghala ghatutendile. Lekeni imunu ayu ng'atendile bae chochose chihile.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kuya kalonga, “Ghwe Yesu ghwe, hautsakutsa mne undewa wako, uleke kunisemwa.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela ghendo, leloli kutsokala na nene kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:45-56; Maliki 15:33-41; Yohane 19:28-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Tsaikala saa sita, kung'ali ne ichisi muisi mwose mbaka saa tisa <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuya lipatsiya lye ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka pfihindi pfili. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Baho Yesu kakemelela, kalonga, “Aba, mne ghamoko ghako nakwika muhe wangu!” Hayalongile apfo, kafa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yula imkulu we asikali ghana limwe wa chilumi honile ighalawile, kamtunya Imulungu, kalonga, “Kweli imunu ayu tsakanogha!” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Iwanu wose iwetingane kulola ipfinu apfo, hawonile ighalawile, waghenda mmakaye mwawo, wetowatowa mmambagha mwawo kwa usungu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lekeni awala wose iwammanyile wema kwa kutali, wolola ipfinu apfo. Mghati mwawo tsawakala iwapinga iwamuwinzile Yesu kulawa Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosikighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:57-61; Maliki 15:42-47; Yohane 10:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v"/>Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe, taghwa lyake Yosefu yolawila Arimataya mne ghumji ghwa Yudeya. Imunu yuno tsakanogha, na mtenda ghanoghile naye yang'ali yobetetsa Undewa we Imulungu. Hata ka tsakakala yumwe mne iwakulu we libalatsa lya Wayahudi, ng'atoghole bae chawatendile weyaghe. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kaghenda kwa Pilato, kalomba lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kaluhulumsa, kalupfatsa sanda, kalwika mne likabuli ilisongolighwe mbambalawe, nalyo ng'ana litsikighwe imunu bae. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Tsaikala Ijumaa, litsuwa lya ukwiyandaa, na litsuwa lya Sabato tsalyahabehi kwandusa. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na awala iwapinga iwatsile na Yesu kulawa Galilaya wamuwinza Yosefu na walyona likabuli na lukuli lwa Yesu halwikighwe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kuya woya akaye watanda ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya.</para>
  <para style="p">Mne litsuwa lya Sabato wabwihila ka pfailaghitsighwe.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:1-10; Maliki 16:1-8; Yohane 20:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>12Litsuwa lya Jumapili lupfilipfili, iwapinga wasola ghamanukato ighawatandile na waghenda kune likabuli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walifika libwe lya kughubikila likabuli libingilisighwa hambalimbali mwe likabuli.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Libwe lya kughubikila likabuli libingilisighwa hambalimbali mwe likabuli</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wengila mne likabuli, lekeni ng'awonile bae lukuli lwe Imtwatsa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wokangawala kwa chinu acho, bahala iwanu weli iwapfalile ghamaghwanda ghang'alile ng'ani wema habehi nawo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wapinga wala wapfuka ng'ani na kwinamila hasi. Baho iwanu wala wawalongela, “Ule mumbama imunu mghima mne iwanu iwafile? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka! Mkumbuke chayawalongele hayakalile mne isi ya Galilaya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa aghoghighwe ne iwanu wane nzambi, nawo watsomuwamba mna msalaba, na litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya iwapinga wala wakumbuka imbuli haila yawalongele. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hawoyile kulawa mne likabuli, wawalongela mbuli atso iwanang'ina wala kumi na yumwe wa Yesu ne iwanu wangi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwapinga iwalongile mbuli atso kwe iwatumighwa wa Yesu tsawakala Mariya Magidalena, Yoana, na Mariya mai wake Jakobu, ne iwapinga wangi welongotse nawo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni iwatumighwa wa Yesu wayona imbuli ilongighwe ne iwapinga wala yahela mana, apfo ng'awatoghole bae. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni Petiri kalawa na kutsuma mbaka mne likabuli. Hayafikile, kenama na kusungulila mghati, baho kayona isanda iliyeka. Kuya koya ukaye aku kakangawala kwa aghala ighalawile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kelangusa kwe iwanang'ina weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 16:12-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lilila, iwanu weli iwamwinzile Yesu wakala woghenda mne ichitobogha ichikemighwe Emau, utali wa maili saba kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wakala welongetsa wao kwa wao kwa aghala ghose ighalawile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Baho hawakalile welongetsa na kwighutsa, Yesu imwenyegho kalawila na kelongotsa nawo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamwona, lekeni ng'awammanyile bae. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Mwoghenda mwelongetsa choni?” Nawo wema na wanyamala, pfihanga pfawo pfonesa usungu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe mne iwanu awo, yakemighwe Kileopa, kamwidika, “Pfii, ghweghwe kwa mhenza uliyeka mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ng'una umanye bae ipfinu pfilawile ako mne ghamatsuwa agha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Ipfinu pfachi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nawo wedika, “Ipfinu ipfimlawile Yesu wa Natsareti. Imunu ayo kakala nabii iyodaha kutenda na kulangulitsa hambele he Imulungu ne iwanu wose. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwakulu wetu tsawamghala kwe iwakulu wa Chirumi yahighighwe ukufa, nawo wamuwamba mna msalaba; <verse number="21" style="v"/>tsatulolela yeye iyo iyatsowakombola Waisiraeli. Lekeni leloli litsuwa lya kadatu kulawa ipfilawile ipfinu apfo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pfipfila, iwapinga wangi kulawa mne kingili lyetu tsawatutenda tukangawale. Lupfilipfili tsawaghenda mne likabuli, <verse number="23" style="v"/>lekeni ng'awalufikile bae lukuli lwake. Woya na kutulongela walawilighwa ne wamalaika iwawalongele Yesu kakala mghima. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wamwenga iwalongotsagha na twetwe tsawaghenda mne likabuli, nawo wapfika ka iwapinga pfawalongile, ng'awamwonile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mbona, mwawabotsi pfino! Na imimoyo yenu mikomu kutoghola ghose ighalongighwe ne manabii! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pfii, ng'aibamighwe bae Kiristu kudununzika apfi, na hambele kwingila mne utunitso wake?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela ghoya ipfinu pfose ipfimlangusa yeye imwenyegho mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, kwandusila mne ipfitabu ipfiandikighwe na Musa na kughendelela mne ipfitabu pfe manabii wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Baho hawatsifikile tsikaye tsiwang'alii wotsighendela, Yesu katenda ka kolumbilila. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lekeni wamlomba ghendo, “Ukale na twetwe, kwaapfila litsuwa liswa, na chilo chakwingila.” Apfo kaghenda, kakala nawo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hayakalile hasi na kuja ichijo hamwe nawo, kasola chighate, kalonga mighede kwe Imulungu, kachibena, kaweng'a. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bahala, tsinenge tsawo tsipfumbuka nawo wammanya, naye kagha mnenge mwawo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tsaweghutsa, “Apfi imimoyo yetu ng'aili yakwaka bae hayakalile kotulongela mnzila na kutulongela ghoya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bahala woka na kuya Yerusalemu. Wawafika iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe wa Yesu, ne iwanu wangi iwakalile, nawo wetingana hamwe <verse number="34" style="v"/>wolonga, “Imtwatsa katsilihuka ghendo! Kamlawila Simoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wala weli wawalongela achila ichiwalawile mnzila, na pfawamtangile Yesu hayachimeghile chighate.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:16-20; Maliki 16:14-18; Yohane 20:19-23; Ghamatendo 1:6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wowalongela apfo, Yesu imwenyegho kema hamwe nawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Weduka na kupfuka, wapfikitsa waghwona ghumtsimu! <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lekeni kawalongela, “Mbona mwoghaya? Ebali mwoghanzika mne imimoyo yenu? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mlole ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghangu na mmanye nene na-mwenyegho! Mnikinde mwone; kwaapfila ghumtsimu ghwahela lukuli ne imipate ka pfimmbona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hayakalile kolonga apfo, kawalangusa ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hawang'ali ng'awodaha bae kutoghola kwa kudeng'elela na kukangawala ng'ani, Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna ichijo chochose hano?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wamwing'a chihindi cha isomba yokighwe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kachisola, kachija wose womlolesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela, “Aghano ghagho malonga ghangu ghaniwalongele, ahala hanikalile hamwe na namwe. Tsaibamighwa ghatendeke aghala ghose ghanyandikighwe nene mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na mne ipfitabu pfa manabii na Tsaburi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuya katsimwemwesela tsimbutsi tsawo wadahe kughamanya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa apfi, Kiristu katsodununzika na litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iwanu wose watsopetelighwa kwa taghwa lyake watsileke nzambi tsawo, naye Imulungu katsowaleghusila nzambi tsawo, kwandusila Yerusalemu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Namwe mwa-wakalangama we ipfinu pfino. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Na nene imwenyegho nitsowaghalila ayula Aba wangu yalongile katsomtuma. Lekeni mwemwe mbete mne bululu mbaka mtsokwing'ighwa ila ingupfu kulawa uchanya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuya kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 16:19-20; Ghamatendo 1:9-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongotsa kunze mwe ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mbaka Betaniya, naye kenula uchanya ghamoko ghake, kawabaliki. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Hayang'ali yowabaliki, kawaleka, kasolighwa kughenda kulanga. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nawo wamtowela ghamaghoti, kuya woya Yerusalemu kuno wodeng'elela <verse number="53" style="v"/>Waghendelela kukala hane Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kumtunya Imulungu.</para>
</usx>
